WEBVTT

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.640
Now, who's this?

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:27.470
Akai?!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.240
Stay out of this, Akai!

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.490
She's Public Security's prey!

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.500
What?!

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:55.690
You're not getting away!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.160
Shit!

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:21.800
If we let her escape, 
there'll be worldwide panic!

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:28.720
No way!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.350
She's going against the traffic?!

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.560
Rye!

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.170
Interesting.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.050
I'll run you down!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:23.920
Akai.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.920
You bastard!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.100
<i>It's me.</i>

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.490
She got away.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.250
Please take care of the cover-up.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.070
<i>Okay.</i>

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:41.470
And the moment 
Ran asked for my name...

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.810
I became Edogawa Conan.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.730
In order to obtain 
information on those guys...

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:50.060
I went to live with Ran, 
whose father is a private detective.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:56.280
By the way, there are others besides the professor who know my identity.

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.230
Haibara Ai.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.280
Her real name is Miyano Shiho.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:04.070
She was originally working 
with the men in black...

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:07.790
But to escape from them,
 she attempted to take her own life...

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:11.060
By taking the same poison I was forced 
to ingest, causing her body to shrink.

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:22.150
The Black Organization 
is enshrouded in mystery.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:27.350
All we know so far is that the members 
are codenamed after alcoholic beverages.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.450
In order to find out more about them...

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:33.860
Some agents voluntarily became members of the Organization as part of an undercover operation.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.080
There's the agent of the 
Central Intelligence Agency, or CIA...

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.840
Mizunashi Rena, code name Kir.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:43.100
Then there's the agent from the NPA's Security Planning Division who goes by the nickname Zero...

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:45.370
Amuro Tooru, 
code name Bourbon.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.390
Furthermore, secretly chasing after the Organization from a different angle...

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.000
There are some agents from 
the Federal Bureau of Investigation, or FBI.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.390
James Black.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:54.650
André Camel.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:55.840
Jodie Starling.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:59.120
And finally, Akai Shuichi.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.560
He's cream of the crop in 
the FBI and a shooting expert.

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:06.850
However, it seems a serious incident 
once took place between him and Amuro.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.520
Even though I've shrunk, 
my mind remains the same...

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.650
That of an unbeaten great detective.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.430
There's always only one truth!

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:17.430
There's always only one truth!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:33.500
Prof, we're out of snacks.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.460
Eh?! 
You already ate them all?!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.880
You ate our share, too?

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.080
My bad, my bad.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.850
Didn't the professor say 
those were for all of us?!

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.390
You look pretty serious.

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:42.640
What are you looking at?

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.330
We're almost there, 
so don't get all riled up.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:46.750
The cause of yesterday's massive blackout hasn't been announced yet...

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.580
You're unbelievable, Genta-kun.

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.640
Just let it go.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.640
So I've been watching the news, 
thinking that's strange.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.810
Ah!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:52.850
They're doing a special feature 
on the aquarium we're going to!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.020
Really? 
Let me see, Conan-kun!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.540
O-Okay.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.640
Let me see it, too!

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.530
<i>This is the Touto Aquarium.</i>

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.320
Man, this seatbelt is in the way.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.920
Hey, don't take it off
while the car's moving!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.070
<i>It had been closed for 
renovations since last year...</i>

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:09.450
<i>But it's finally re-opening today, 
so we now bring you the latest on it.</i>

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.320
How boring.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.990
We're almost there, 
so please be patient, Genta-kun.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.680
Ah, it's started!

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:16.840
<i>So with the following footage, allow me to introduce the points 
that have changed the most since the renovation.</i>

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:21.900
<i>There are three major points 
that have changed as part of the renovation.</i>

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:23.840
<i>The first thing we want 
to direct your attention to...</i>

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:29.160
<i>Is that all the attractions 
and shops have been moved indoors.</i>

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.690
<i>Thus, you never have to 
worry about the weather...</i>

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:38.110
<i>Allowing you to enjoy all the facilities to your 
heart's content from opening until closing time!</i>

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:42.890
<i>The next thing you should pay attention 
to is this aquarium's top selling point...</i>

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:46.070
<i>The magnificent dolphin show!</i>

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.350
<i>It has long been 
a popular attraction...</i>

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:50.580
<i>But everything in the show 
has now been revamped!</i>

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.300
<i>The dolphins' performance 
has been even further refined...</i>

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:56.840
<i>So it's sure to give us 
a surprising and exciting time!</i>

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:56.840
<i>The dolphin kissed me!</i>

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.110
<i>Bye-bye.</i>

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.770
<i>Wow, I'm jealous.</i>

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:04.270
<i>And the last thing we're introducing today is
the biggest selling point after the renovation...</i>

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.220
<i>Let me touch one, too.</i>

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:07.220
<i>The world's first-ever 
double Ferris wheel.</i>

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:12.690
<i>With a north wheel on one side,
 and a south wheel on the other...</i>

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:16.630
<i>You'll be able to feast your eyes on different scenery, 
depending on which one you choose to ride.</i>

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:19.570
<i>Also, as the fountains have been
 moved closer to the Ferris wheel...</i>

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.380
<i>You can enjoy the 
special water and light show...</i>

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:27.040
<i>Along with the scenery, 
from 100 meters above the ground!</i>

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.400
<i>It's so exciting!</i>

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.960
Let's go on that Ferris wheel!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.010
Yeah, let's do that!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.620
Weren't we going to the aquarium?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.420
We could go to both, couldn't we?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:37.840
Yeah!

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.940
Yeah, let's go to both!

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:40.880
Professor...

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.100
Thanks in advance 
for paying for the tickets.

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:47.160
Wow! 
Now we can see the huge wheel!

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.070
You're right!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.310
Amazing!

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:51.260
We'll be there 
in less than five minutes.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:22.090
We're here.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.060
Let's go!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:26.170
I'm so excited!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.890
Hold on, Genta-kun!

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:29.620
Hurry, Professor!

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.970
Haibara-san and 
Conan-kun, please hurry!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:37.440
So which one did you decide upon? The aquarium or the Ferris wheel?

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:37.960
Eh?!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.590
What are you sayin', Professor?

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.730
Of course we're going to both!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:43.730
Well then, 
here's a challenge for you!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:48.490
If you can answer the quiz I'm
about to give, I'll take you to both.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.910
Well, here it comes!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:53.080
If you paint many layers of a color 
without mixing it with another...

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.250
Which one of the following 
four colors will change?

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.270
1. Red.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:00.700
2. Blue.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.260
3. Brown.

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:03.750
4. Black.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.810
Without mixing it...

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:08.090
A color that changes 
when you paint many layers of it?

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:11.070
Ah, I have no idea!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:14.300
Professor, 
that's very immature.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:18.550
It might be a little easier to understand 
if you use different words to describe the colors.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:21.240
Hey, Conan-kun, 
you can't participate in the quiz!

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.540
Use a different word 
to describe them?

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.710
makka

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.710
For example, red becomes "scarlet".

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.020
massao

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.020
Blue turns into "aquamarine".

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.270
Ai-kun, don't tell them th—

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.440
I figured it out!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:28.860
What?!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.200
matcha

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.200
So that means brown turns into "deep brown".

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.880
Oh, it transformed!

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.550
Yeah.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.780
What're you talking about?

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.610
Red turns into "scarlet", 
blue turns into "aquamarine"...

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:41.500
Brown turns into "deep brown", and black turns into "jet black".

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:44.470
Please try to focus 
on brown, Genta-kun.

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:47.110
matcha

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:47.110
Only brown turns into green tea!

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.970
You're right! 
It turns into matcha green tea!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:52.510
Wait a minute! 
It's unfair for you two to give them hints!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.950
Okay! 
Let's go buy the tickets.

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.230
Yeah!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:57.140
Hey, wait!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.340
Let's get on the Ferris wheel first!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.850
matcha

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.850
You can't go to both, no... Please, "wait"!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.310
Come over here, guys.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.920
The Ferris wheel 
has a really long line.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.440
It'll probably take about an hour.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.700
The Ferris wheel is so big.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.700
I wonder if we can see 
our house from up there.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.800
I want to eat ice cream.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.190
What's wrong?

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.770
W-Wait!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.620
I'll buy one for you later.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:19.150
Hey... 
Are you all right, Miss?

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.580
Huh?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.850
There's something on your face!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:28.820
Wow, your left and right 
eyes have different colors!

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:30.820
Could it be that she doesn't 
understand Japanese that well?

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.680
I understand... I understand...

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.680
What's wrong?

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.340
Why are you here all alone?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.590
It doesn't look like you 
have any friends here with you...

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:41.630
And worse, 
your knee and hand are injured...

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:44.230
It also looks like 
your phone's broken.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.980
Here, lemme take a look at it.

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.180
Okay.

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:49.660
How long have 
you been here, Miss?

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.890
Um...

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.530
Then, where did you 
come from to get here?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.360
I don't know.

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.370
What's your name, Miss?

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.020
My name...

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:04.000
S-Sorry, I don't know.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.250
Can I take a look at your head?

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.670
Y-Yeah.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:12.340
It's not a big injury, 
but it's relatively recent.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.840
She was probably driving a car, and got into an accident in which she injured her head.

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:19.680
If that's the case, this is 
retrograde amnesia due to trauma.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:20.410
Wait...

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.720
How do you know 
she was driving a car?

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:27.650
This smartphone suffered an impact strong enough to completely destroy it.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.190
And look...

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.270
It's a shard from 
a car's windshield.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:34.280
So, that means she hit 
her head while driving?

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:37.450
And the car must've 
been a very old model...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:42.410
Because recent models use laminated glass 
to avoid having shards of glass flying around.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.000
Besides, you can catch the faint smell 
of gasoline coming from her body.

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:49.290
You're right.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:53.000
Do you have 
anything else on you, Miss?

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:00.120
What's this?

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.390
Let me see it, Miss.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.510
O-Okay.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.850
What's that?

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.640
What is this?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:09.310
It looks like a ring of vocab flashcards, 
but the cards are translucently colored.

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.810
What are these cards for?

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.070
Hey!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.570
Conan! Haibara!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.150
We bought tickets for both of you, too!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.660
Come on, let's go ride the Ferris wheel!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.660
Crap! 
The nuisances are back.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.820
Huh?

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.780
Who is this lady?

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:23.660
Wow!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.330
Your left and right eyes 
have different colors!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.290
They're so pretty!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.620
Is one of them a fake eye?

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:33.290
That's not it, Genta-kun. 
I think she's odd-eyed.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.670
odd-eyed

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.670
Oddo Ai?

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:37.050
This lady sure has a funny name.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:40.180
Ah, no. 
That's not her name.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.390
I got it!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.800
You're talking 
about a seal's eyes, right?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.640
Seal?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.730
You're talking about eyes, 
aren't you, Conan-kun?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.940
Y-Yeah.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:51.520
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.900
We made her laugh.

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:58.400
By the way, what 
are you all doing here?

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.950
Perfect timing, Professor.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:04.830
This lady seems to have lost her memories 
because she was in an accident.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.520
Is that really true, Shin—

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.200
Er, Conan-kun?

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.040
Yeah.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.880
It may be related 
to last night's accident...

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.540
Then we should take her 
to the police immediately!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:14.420
Stop!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:17.300
Miss...

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.760
Is there some reason 
why you can't go to the police?

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.510
I-I don't know...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.510
But the police have to 
take her under their custody.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:27.500
Come now!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.050
You can't take pictures 
of someone out of the blue.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.050
Hey! Conan-kun!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:29.770
Wait, Miss!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.850
We're not reporting 
this to the police.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:37.320
I needed pictures of you to see if
I can find someone who knows you.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.900
Someone who knows me?

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:42.030
Yeah, let me help you 
regain your memory.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.660
Are you serious, Conan?!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.410
Please let us help too!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:51.410
After all, we're the Detective Boys!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:57.170
We'll look for your friends 
to help you get your memory back!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.590
Please rest assured.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.180
Thank you.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:05.010
Then, let's start by looking for someone who knows this lady!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:05.680
Yes.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.720
You guys, 
what about the Ferris wheel?

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.310
What are you saying, Professor?

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.230
This ain't the time to be riding that!

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.690
Let's start by asking 
that dolphin guy.

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:13.580
No way.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.460
I already bought 
the tickets for you, too...

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.200
You're in the way, Professor!

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:17.570
Let's go now.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.690
Yeah, let's go!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.030
Let's go look for them!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.360
Come on, hurry!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:23.760
Hey, you guys...

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.370
Don't just play around! 
You have to take this seriously!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.120
You couldn't possibly be planning on not taking her to the police, right?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.750
Of course I will!

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:37.710
<i>Last night, a vehicle traveling down 
Route 11 of the Shuto Expressway...</i>

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:42.260
<i>Was involved in an accident that ended with it erupting into flames in the warehouse area beneath the overpass.</i>

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:45.430
<i>Miraculously, no casualties 
surfaced as a result of this accident...</i>

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:43.590
Dad.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.390
Right, Yoko-chan?

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:48.100
<i>But the driver of the vehicle 
appears to have fled from the scene...</i>

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.890
<i>And the police are still trying 
to determine his or her whereabouts.</i>

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.140
<i>There is currently little information...</i>

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:53.310
Sheesh.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:55.900
Dad!

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:59.070
How long are you going to 
slack off in your work and sleep for?!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.610
Pipe down!

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:04.490
Detectives have to give their 
brains some rest, you know!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:07.450
In other words, your head hurts 
because you drank too much.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.830
H-How did you—

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.540
No, I said no such thing!

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.210
Here. 
It's from Conan-kun.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:18.000
They've taken an amnesiac under their care and want us to take her to the police.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.630
I already informed Detective Takagi,
 but please help them too, Dad.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.120
W-What a beauty!

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.840
Are you even listening?

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.510
Where is this 
beautiful lady right now?

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.510
H-He said she's at Touto Aquarium.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.890
Okay!

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:33.140
Wait, Dad...

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:36.500
The great detective is on the case!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:38.150
No, it's not a case...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:40.650
Oh, come on.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:42.650
Inspector.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:46.650
This is the picture 
Ran-san sent to me earlier.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.160
I see.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:51.530
According to the report, there's a chance she's been in a traffic accident.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.830
A traffic accident, huh?

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:55.790
There was a major accident last night...

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.790
And if I'm not mistaken, 
the driver is still missing.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:00.680
And although it was 
such a massive accident...

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:04.510
We don't have any precise information about it, much less the media.

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:05.970
Do you think this is...?

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.680
Seems like we need to investigate it.

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:10.440
Inspector Megure!

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:10.760
Oh?

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:11.970
How did it go?

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:16.560
Division Three didn't have any 
particular information on the case, either.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.020
I see.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:19.770
What is it?

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:24.400
I've heard rumors that someone 
infiltrated the National Police Agency last night.

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:25.780
The National Police Agency?!

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:29.860
However, the MPD headquarters has received no such information.

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:31.870
What could be going on?

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:38.000
Some great power might be at work.

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:50.010
<i>Thank you for stopping by 
the Touto Aquarium Shopping Mall.</i>

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:53.260
<i>Please take your time 
and enjoy your shopping.</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:56.930
Huh?

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:00.020
There she is.

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:03.520
I found her, Gin.

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:04.820
<i>Where is she?</i>

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:06.180
Touto Aquarium.

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:07.280
<i>The aquarium?!</i>

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.530
Yes.

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:11.490
Rest assured. 
I'll bring her back right away.

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:18.960
<i>We thank you for coming today.</i>

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:20.160
Is the dolphin show starting yet?

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.580
<i>The special dolphin show 
will begin momentarily.</i>

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:26.840
Has she really been here before?

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:27.460
I know...

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:34.300
And with such distinctive hair and eye colors, 
it's odd that nobody remembers her.

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.890
Now, where do you plan to go next?

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:40.480
We've already covered 
most of the grounds.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:41.980
You can do it, Miss!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.900
That's the last one. 
Please aim carefully.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:46.650
I can't believe those guys.

00:23:56.250 --> 00:23:56.990
Wow!

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.700
Congratulations!

00:23:58.700 --> 00:24:01.330
You've gotten today's highest score!

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:03.830
You too, Miss.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.840
Please hold both of your hands out.

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:07.340
Yay!

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.630
I wanna do it, too!

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:09.960
Me three!

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:11.260
Okay.

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:12.180
You did it!

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:13.340
I'm next.

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:15.970
Oh! 
You smiled again, Miss!

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:19.850
I thought so.
It's better when you smile, Miss.

00:24:19.850 --> 00:24:20.350
Yeah.

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:21.660
Agreed.

00:24:21.660 --> 00:24:22.620
You really think so?

00:24:22.620 --> 00:24:23.770
It definitely is!

00:24:23.770 --> 00:24:27.020
Please choose three 
keychains as your prize.

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:29.230
Yay!

00:24:29.230 --> 00:24:30.860
We can have three?

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:31.530
I want that one!

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:32.240
This one for me!

00:24:32.240 --> 00:24:33.810
And I'll take that one!

00:24:33.810 --> 00:24:35.450
Okay, so this one is yours.

00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:37.030
Huh? 
What about you, Miss?

00:24:37.030 --> 00:24:38.370
No, I'm fine.

00:24:38.370 --> 00:24:39.700
Don't worry about me.

00:24:39.700 --> 00:24:41.140
But...

00:24:41.140 --> 00:24:43.330
You're the one 
who won these, Miss...

00:24:43.330 --> 00:24:44.870
Hey, you guys!

00:24:44.870 --> 00:24:45.880
Oh, Conan-kun.

00:24:45.880 --> 00:24:47.200
Ai-chan.

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.880
You sure seem 
to be enjoying yourselves...

00:24:48.880 --> 00:24:51.760
But weren't you gonna help 
the lady regain her memory?

00:24:51.760 --> 00:24:52.800
Well...

00:24:52.800 --> 00:24:55.550
We were planning to 
start after trying this game.

00:24:55.550 --> 00:24:59.140
And then the 
lady won these for us!

00:24:59.140 --> 00:25:01.060
Aren't they amazing?

00:24:59.140 --> 00:25:01.810
Oh, brother... 
They're only just getting started?

00:24:59.140 --> 00:25:01.810
Oh, brother... 
They're only just getting started?

00:25:01.060 --> 00:25:04.020
Then, how about we start gathering 
information for real now?

00:25:01.800 --> 00:25:05.060
Looks like we should be 
the ones covering this area, too.

00:25:04.020 --> 00:25:05.060
Yeah, we should!

00:25:05.060 --> 00:25:07.300
Hey, you guys!

00:25:07.300 --> 00:25:08.860
Over here, over here!

00:25:08.860 --> 00:25:10.900
It's everyone's favorite Hiroshi!

00:25:10.900 --> 00:25:12.030
Professor!

00:25:12.030 --> 00:25:12.760
I'm over here!

00:25:12.760 --> 00:25:15.110
What are you doing up there?

00:25:15.110 --> 00:25:17.660
The crowd for 
the Ferris wheel thinned out!

00:25:17.660 --> 00:25:20.240
Now's your chance 
if you want to ride it!

00:25:20.240 --> 00:25:21.540
Seriously?

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:24.290
Then, why don't we start 
after riding the Ferris wheel?

00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:25.120
Sounds good.

00:25:25.120 --> 00:25:28.210
She might be able to remember something by observing the scenery.

00:25:28.210 --> 00:25:29.250
All right!

00:25:29.250 --> 00:25:32.000
Let's go ride the Ferris wheel, Miss!

00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:33.760
Let's go, let's go!

00:25:33.760 --> 00:25:35.050
Jeez.

00:25:35.050 --> 00:25:38.890
Well, let's just let them go with 
the Ferris wheel-obsessed professor.

00:25:40.680 --> 00:25:43.810
So, the professor's the one 
who wanted to ride it the most?

00:25:44.740 --> 00:25:45.810
You bet.

00:25:45.810 --> 00:25:47.040
Excuse me.

00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:50.400
Do you remember seeing the lady 
who was just playing darts here before?

00:25:51.250 --> 00:25:53.610
Do you mean the silver-haired 
woman who was just here?

00:25:53.610 --> 00:25:55.780
Yeah!
Do you know her, Mister?

00:25:55.780 --> 00:25:58.490
No, I don't remember 
ever seeing her before.

00:25:58.490 --> 00:26:02.540
And there's no way I could forget 
a customer with such skill.

00:26:03.520 --> 00:26:05.330
All of them were 
double bull's-eyes?

00:26:03.520 --> 00:26:05.330
All of them were 
double bull's-eyes?

00:26:05.330 --> 00:26:07.920
You can't pull off 
that feat by sheer coincidence.

00:26:05.330 --> 00:26:07.920
You can't pull off 
that feat by sheer coincidence.

00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:09.380
Thanks, Mister.

00:26:09.380 --> 00:26:10.750
Oh, right.

00:26:10.750 --> 00:26:11.250
Huh?

00:26:11.250 --> 00:26:14.780
Can I have you give this 
to your friend who was here earlier?

00:26:14.780 --> 00:26:16.090
Oh, what is it?

00:26:16.650 --> 00:26:19.090
We had a bunch of prototypes 
from before we painted them.

00:26:19.090 --> 00:26:23.100
The lady didn't win enough for her to have one, 
so I was wondering if this would do.

00:26:23.100 --> 00:26:26.980
Since it hasn't been painted yet, tell her 
to enjoy painting it whatever color she likes.

00:26:26.980 --> 00:26:27.600
Okay.

00:26:27.600 --> 00:26:29.440
I'm sure she'll be happy.

00:26:29.440 --> 00:26:31.110
Thank you, Mister.

00:26:31.110 --> 00:26:33.520
Alright, have fun now.

00:26:33.520 --> 00:26:34.780
Let's go, Haibara.

00:26:34.780 --> 00:26:36.250
W-What?

00:26:36.250 --> 00:26:37.740
W-Where next?

00:26:37.740 --> 00:26:41.310
Once we're done gathering info in the remaining areas that are under construction...

00:26:41.310 --> 00:26:42.870
Let's rejoin the professor 
and the others.

00:26:43.640 --> 00:26:46.620
There's the whole thing with the darts just now, 
but rather than looking for a trail to follow...

00:26:46.620 --> 00:26:50.370
I think it's a better plan 
for us to simply go along with her.

00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:03.620
I really want a dolphin strap!

00:27:03.620 --> 00:27:05.230
I'd like a jellyfish one!

00:27:06.640 --> 00:27:08.480
I'm so excited!

00:27:08.480 --> 00:27:10.980
I wonder what we'll 
see once we're high up.

00:27:10.980 --> 00:27:13.190
I'm sure we'll be able to 
see the Bell Tree Tower!

00:27:12.350 --> 00:27:14.320
What are you doing here?

00:27:13.190 --> 00:27:14.890
Oh, you're right!

00:27:14.320 --> 00:27:16.150
Let's head back.

00:27:16.950 --> 00:27:18.180
Hey, Miss...

00:27:18.180 --> 00:27:20.820
You'll get left behind 
if you keep spacing out!

00:27:20.820 --> 00:27:21.860
Sorry.

00:27:21.860 --> 00:27:25.010
I got the feeling 
someone was talking to me.

00:27:25.010 --> 00:27:27.160
Oh? 
Someone you know was here?

00:27:27.160 --> 00:27:29.790
No, it seems I was mistaken.

00:27:29.790 --> 00:27:31.790
You're all going together, correct?

00:27:31.790 --> 00:27:33.040
Yeah!

00:27:33.040 --> 00:27:34.670
This way, please.

00:27:35.650 --> 00:27:37.300
Change of plan.

00:27:37.300 --> 00:27:39.170
We've run into some kind of trouble.

00:27:39.170 --> 00:27:40.470
<i>Hurry it up.</i>

00:27:40.470 --> 00:27:42.800
<i>We can't let her do as she pleases.</i>

00:27:42.800 --> 00:27:44.140
I know.

00:27:47.010 --> 00:27:48.470
Wait up, Mom!

00:27:48.470 --> 00:27:51.560
In the end, we didn't gather anything 
from the areas under construction, either.

00:27:51.560 --> 00:27:54.730
Could you contact the 
professor for me soon, Haibara?

00:27:55.680 --> 00:27:56.230
What?

00:27:56.770 --> 00:27:59.030
What's wrong? 
You've been spacing out for a while now.

00:27:59.030 --> 00:28:00.150
H-Have I now?

00:28:00.150 --> 00:28:02.860
Hey, Conan! Haibara!

00:28:02.860 --> 00:28:04.410
We're right here!

00:28:04.410 --> 00:28:06.370
Up here, above you!

00:28:06.370 --> 00:28:08.160
Over here!

00:28:08.160 --> 00:28:10.040
Can you see us now?

00:28:10.040 --> 00:28:11.290
Didn't we tell you we'd be here?

00:28:11.290 --> 00:28:12.080
Genta, step back!

00:28:11.290 --> 00:28:12.080
Watch out!

00:28:12.080 --> 00:28:13.870
Huh? Why?

00:28:13.870 --> 00:28:15.000
Genta-kun!

00:28:17.050 --> 00:28:17.380
Genta!

00:28:19.930 --> 00:28:21.010
Genta-kun!

00:28:21.010 --> 00:28:21.970
I'm gonna fall.

00:28:21.970 --> 00:28:23.680
Save me, Miss!

00:28:22.360 --> 00:28:23.680
<b>I can't do anything here.</b>

00:28:22.360 --> 00:28:23.680
<b>I can't do anything here.</b>

00:28:23.680 --> 00:28:26.050
I-I can't hold on anymore!

00:28:26.050 --> 00:28:27.430
Genta-kun!

00:28:28.060 --> 00:28:28.970
Huh?

00:28:53.550 --> 00:28:54.790
Genta, are you okay?

00:28:54.790 --> 00:28:56.580
Genta-kun, are you okay?!

00:28:56.580 --> 00:28:57.590
Stay with me!

00:29:04.310 --> 00:29:06.760
Huh? 
Why are you here, Miss?

00:29:06.760 --> 00:29:07.970
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:29:12.100 --> 00:29:13.600
Oh, I remember now.

00:29:13.600 --> 00:29:16.900
I fell down from up there.

00:29:16.900 --> 00:29:19.230
Are you okay? 
Are either of you hurt?

00:29:19.230 --> 00:29:22.070
This lady saved me, so I'm fine!

00:29:22.070 --> 00:29:23.070
Thank goodness.

00:29:23.070 --> 00:29:25.990
Please go to the on-site
medical room, just in case.

00:29:31.390 --> 00:29:32.910
What's going on?

00:29:34.220 --> 00:29:36.920
Okay, that should do it.

00:29:36.920 --> 00:29:39.340
Oh, thank you!

00:29:39.340 --> 00:29:40.840
My poor back.

00:29:40.840 --> 00:29:42.170
Ouch, it hurts.

00:29:42.170 --> 00:29:45.380
Why is the professor 
the one in the most pain?

00:29:45.380 --> 00:29:47.010
That's pathetic.

00:29:47.010 --> 00:29:48.590
Yeah, he's acting really childish.

00:29:48.590 --> 00:29:51.140
You guys will understand 
when you get older.

00:29:51.140 --> 00:29:54.930
The professor seems okay too, 
so let's go ride the Ferris wheel!

00:29:54.930 --> 00:29:56.270
Thank you, Miss!

00:29:56.270 --> 00:29:56.980
Let's go!

00:29:56.980 --> 00:29:57.980
And you can go with us!

00:29:57.980 --> 00:30:02.940
O-Okay...
But I'm not bothering you, am I?

00:30:02.940 --> 00:30:05.360
What are you talking about now?

00:30:05.360 --> 00:30:08.030
You saved my life, you know!

00:30:08.030 --> 00:30:08.610
That's right!

00:30:08.610 --> 00:30:10.410
Then, how about we go ride it?

00:30:10.410 --> 00:30:11.280
Wait!

00:30:11.280 --> 00:30:13.950
Edogawa-kun, I need to talk to you.

00:30:13.950 --> 00:30:14.950
Okay.

00:30:14.950 --> 00:30:17.310
We'll go ahead then—

00:30:17.310 --> 00:30:17.960
No, don't!

00:30:17.960 --> 00:30:19.670
Please wait, Professor.

00:30:19.670 --> 00:30:20.960
O-Okay.

00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:23.630
I wonder what's wrong.

00:30:23.630 --> 00:30:25.340
How boring.

00:30:32.560 --> 00:30:34.010
What? What is it?

00:30:34.010 --> 00:30:35.140
Okay, are you listening?

00:30:35.140 --> 00:30:39.440
While Conan-kun and 
Haibara-san are busy talking...

00:30:40.540 --> 00:30:44.150
Are you positive 
that she's one of them?

00:30:44.150 --> 00:30:48.740
I can't say for sure,
 but didn't you feel it too?

00:30:50.380 --> 00:30:51.780
Her right eye...

00:30:51.780 --> 00:30:54.200
Now that I think about it, 
it looks almost like a prosthetic.

00:30:54.860 --> 00:30:56.160
Like a prosthetic...

00:30:56.160 --> 00:30:56.830
You don't mean—

00:30:56.830 --> 00:31:01.500
Yeah, the second in command of 
what you call the "Black Organization"!

00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:06.210
Rum.

00:31:11.260 --> 00:31:13.390
Miss... Miss.

00:31:14.330 --> 00:31:14.810
What?

00:31:22.450 --> 00:31:24.110
If we assume she's Rum...

00:31:24.110 --> 00:31:27.610
Then it calls into question 
whether she's even truly lost her memory.

00:31:27.610 --> 00:31:31.200
If I remember correctly, 
Rum's gender and age are unknown, aren't they?

00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:32.660
Yeah.

00:31:32.660 --> 00:31:36.450
I heard several rumors about them while I was in the Organization.

00:31:36.450 --> 00:31:38.500
Some described 
a large, strong man...

00:31:38.500 --> 00:31:40.330
Others, an effeminate man...

00:31:40.330 --> 00:31:41.790
And others described an old man.

00:31:41.790 --> 00:31:43.280
Everyone had their own idea.

00:31:43.280 --> 00:31:43.830
And...

00:31:45.600 --> 00:31:47.870
Because they injured their 
eye in some sort of accident...

00:31:47.870 --> 00:31:51.130
Either their left 
or right eyeball is artificial.

00:31:52.130 --> 00:31:55.640
If that woman isn't odd-eyed, 
but instead has an artificial eye, then...

00:31:55.640 --> 00:31:57.150
I see.

00:31:57.150 --> 00:31:59.770
So you think she's just 
pretending to have amnesia?

00:32:00.580 --> 00:32:04.270
But why would she need to put on
 an act like that just to get close to us?

00:32:04.270 --> 00:32:06.150
W-Well...

00:32:06.150 --> 00:32:09.630
It's true that, judging 
from her physical prowess...

00:32:09.630 --> 00:32:12.150
She's likely a member of the Organization, 
and we should keep our guard up.

00:32:12.950 --> 00:32:16.950
But if she really lost her memory, 
if we reversed that...

00:32:16.950 --> 00:32:18.120
You can't!

00:32:18.120 --> 00:32:20.700
You must never help 
her regain her memory!

00:32:20.700 --> 00:32:21.830
Don't tell me you're thinking...

00:32:21.830 --> 00:32:25.540
"After she regains her memory, I can get information about the Organization out of her!"

00:32:25.540 --> 00:32:28.380
You couldn't possibly be 
considering that, right?!

00:32:28.380 --> 00:32:32.130
If you did that, you wouldn't 
just be putting us in danger...

00:32:32.130 --> 00:32:35.260
But the lives of the kids over there might be in danger as well!

00:32:36.920 --> 00:32:37.680
They're gone!

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:39.390
What's the Professor doing?!

00:32:40.640 --> 00:32:41.560
How cute!

00:32:41.560 --> 00:32:42.700
Professor!

00:32:42.700 --> 00:32:43.390
Oh?

00:32:44.950 --> 00:32:47.980
Oh no, the doves!

00:32:47.980 --> 00:32:50.030
This isn't the time for that, Professor!

00:32:50.030 --> 00:32:52.150
Where did the kids go?

00:32:52.150 --> 00:32:53.820
Huh? What?

00:32:54.360 --> 00:32:56.030
Oh no.
It's Conan-kun.

00:32:56.030 --> 00:32:58.030
I wouldn't pick that up, if I were you.

00:32:58.030 --> 00:33:00.040
He's just going to 
be mad at us, anyway.

00:33:00.040 --> 00:33:01.200
You're right.

00:33:01.200 --> 00:33:04.750
Oh, look! 
The doves are flying our way!

00:33:04.750 --> 00:33:05.920
You're right.

00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:07.290
Can you see them too, Miss?

00:33:07.290 --> 00:33:09.000
Yeah, that's a massive flock.

00:33:09.000 --> 00:33:11.090
<i>The number you have called
 cannot be reached at the moment.</i>

00:33:11.090 --> 00:33:12.490
Damn it, those guys!

00:33:12.490 --> 00:33:13.760
They're probably at the Ferris wheel.

00:33:13.760 --> 00:33:16.430
Those kids were 
really wanting to ride it, after all.

00:33:16.430 --> 00:33:17.680
Yeah, let's go.

00:33:17.680 --> 00:33:20.010
H-Hey! 
Wait for me!

00:33:21.530 --> 00:33:25.520
You may have played 
some sort of sport, Miss.

00:33:25.520 --> 00:33:26.270
Eh?

00:33:26.270 --> 00:33:30.320
If you hadn't, you couldn't have saved Genta-kun the way you did.

00:33:30.320 --> 00:33:31.360
That just might be it...

00:33:31.360 --> 00:33:33.490
Because you have 
a good figure, Miss!

00:33:33.490 --> 00:33:35.070
Good figure?

00:33:35.070 --> 00:33:36.610
You think so?

00:33:36.610 --> 00:33:39.700
Yes, you're just like a supermodel!

00:33:39.700 --> 00:33:40.830
Whoa!

00:33:40.830 --> 00:33:42.750
The fountain's gotten bigger!

00:33:42.750 --> 00:33:44.370
It's getting higher and higher!

00:33:44.370 --> 00:33:46.290
This is amazing!

00:33:46.290 --> 00:33:47.920
Can you see it too, Miss?

00:33:47.920 --> 00:33:49.250
Yeah, it's beautiful.

00:33:51.020 --> 00:33:52.840
Look down there, you guys!

00:33:52.840 --> 00:33:54.400
There's a rainbow!

00:33:54.400 --> 00:33:55.760
You too, Miss!
Come to the front!

00:33:55.760 --> 00:33:57.630
O-Okay.

00:34:06.210 --> 00:34:07.770
Oh? 
Are you okay, Miss?

00:34:07.770 --> 00:34:09.560
Is something wrong?

00:34:09.560 --> 00:34:10.520
I'm fine.

00:34:10.520 --> 00:34:11.860
Just a little dizzy.

00:34:11.860 --> 00:34:15.570
You must be scared of high places.

00:34:16.890 --> 00:34:19.720
Hey, it's about to 
reach the highest point!

00:34:19.720 --> 00:34:20.740
You're right!

00:34:20.740 --> 00:34:23.490
I've been waiting for this!

00:34:23.490 --> 00:34:25.660
We're at the 
very top of the top!

00:34:25.660 --> 00:34:26.250
Yeah!

00:34:26.250 --> 00:34:27.290
Wow!

00:34:27.290 --> 00:34:28.840
Look at this view!

00:34:34.660 --> 00:34:35.920
Are you okay, Miss?

00:34:35.920 --> 00:34:38.260
Hey, hang in there!

00:34:38.260 --> 00:34:39.510
Does your head hurt?

00:34:38.260 --> 00:34:39.510
What do we do?

00:34:39.510 --> 00:34:41.800
Wait a second. 
I'll call for help right now.

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:42.810
knock

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:42.810
T-The NOCs...

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:43.510
Ayumi, Mitsuhiko!

00:34:43.510 --> 00:34:44.600
What should we do?

00:34:44.600 --> 00:34:47.060
She was saying something weird.

00:34:47.060 --> 00:34:48.600
She might've 
remembered something!

00:34:48.600 --> 00:34:49.530
knock

00:34:48.600 --> 00:34:49.530
T-The NOCs...

00:34:49.530 --> 00:34:52.650
Ayumi-chan, please 
use this to call Conan-kun.

00:34:52.650 --> 00:34:53.440
Okay.

00:34:53.440 --> 00:34:55.460
What did the lady say, Genta-kun?

00:34:55.460 --> 00:34:56.030
Uh...

00:34:56.030 --> 00:34:58.360
Something about 
knocking on a door.

00:34:58.360 --> 00:34:59.570
A door?

00:34:59.570 --> 00:35:01.210
Kir, Bourbon...

00:35:01.210 --> 00:35:03.460
Hey, she started 
saying something again!

00:35:03.460 --> 00:35:05.740
Shh!
Please keep quiet, Genta-kun.

00:35:05.740 --> 00:35:09.370
Stout, Aquavit, Riesling...

00:35:11.040 --> 00:35:13.540
Please... hurry...

00:35:14.370 --> 00:35:15.460
It's ringing!

00:35:18.160 --> 00:35:18.970
What's wrong?

00:35:18.970 --> 00:35:19.880
It's the phone!

00:35:19.880 --> 00:35:21.010
It might just be...

00:35:21.010 --> 00:35:22.470
Yeah, I knew it.

00:35:23.260 --> 00:35:24.640
Mitsuhiko, what were you thinking?!

00:35:24.640 --> 00:35:26.740
<i>Conan-kun, help!</i>

00:35:26.740 --> 00:35:28.270
Ayumi? 
What's wrong?

00:35:28.270 --> 00:35:32.230
Once we got on the Ferris wheel,
 the lady started not feeling well.

00:35:32.230 --> 00:35:33.090
<i>What?</i>

00:35:33.090 --> 00:35:34.480
<i>How's her condition?</i>

00:35:34.480 --> 00:35:36.420
W-Well...

00:35:36.420 --> 00:35:38.610
She's pressing on her head 
and is in extreme pain.

00:35:38.610 --> 00:35:40.900
She's also saying something, 
but we don't know what it means...

00:35:40.900 --> 00:35:42.600
I'm writing it all down.

00:35:42.600 --> 00:35:44.800
Mitsuhiko-kun's writing it down.

00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:45.410
<i>Got it.</i>

00:35:45.410 --> 00:35:49.000
Conan-kun, 
please hurry and help us!

00:35:55.530 --> 00:35:56.340
Conan-kun.

00:35:56.340 --> 00:35:57.920
Where's the woman you mentioned?

00:35:57.920 --> 00:36:00.130
She's just being carried away 
by the on-site medical team.

00:36:00.130 --> 00:36:02.220
Let's go, Takagi-kun.

00:36:02.220 --> 00:36:02.800
Right.

00:36:02.800 --> 00:36:05.800
Haibara, Professor... 
Please take care of the rest.

00:36:05.800 --> 00:36:07.220
Let's go, too.

00:36:07.220 --> 00:36:08.220
No, you can't!

00:36:08.220 --> 00:36:10.060
Absolutely not!

00:36:19.570 --> 00:36:21.070
We're coming in.

00:36:21.070 --> 00:36:23.280
This way, please.

00:36:23.280 --> 00:36:29.120
As per our talk earlier, 
we'll take her under police custody.

00:36:29.120 --> 00:36:31.000
I don't really mind...

00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:36.290
But there are some things I'd like you to tell the 
doctor of the police hospital you're transferring her to.

00:36:36.290 --> 00:36:43.050
First of all, it's certain that she lost her memory due to suffering a heavy blow to her head.

00:36:43.050 --> 00:36:48.990
But more alarmingly, I've also found she has 
an extremely rare injury in the fornix of her brain...

00:36:48.990 --> 00:36:50.600
Which is this area right here.

00:36:50.600 --> 00:36:53.100
The latter injury isn't 
from last night's accident?

00:36:53.100 --> 00:36:56.610
Correct. 
It's likely something she was born with.

00:36:56.610 --> 00:36:58.860
Did it have anything to do 
with the seizure she just had?

00:36:58.860 --> 00:37:03.860
That part of the brain doesn't affect the 
activities in one's daily life, so I don't believe it did.

00:37:03.860 --> 00:37:06.870
Got it. 
I'll let them know.

00:37:06.870 --> 00:37:07.740
Now, if you'll—

00:37:07.740 --> 00:37:08.870
Ah, please wait.

00:37:08.870 --> 00:37:10.620
There's one more thing.

00:37:10.620 --> 00:37:13.080
We found this out 
when we examined her...

00:37:13.080 --> 00:37:15.370
But this was on her right eye.

00:37:15.370 --> 00:37:17.540
What's that?

00:37:17.540 --> 00:37:19.040
It looks like 
a colored contact lens.

00:37:19.040 --> 00:37:20.060
Yes.

00:37:20.060 --> 00:37:24.420
It's a colored contact lens to 
make the pupils in her eyes appear black.

00:37:24.420 --> 00:37:30.430
Although I believe it has nothing to do with her memory loss or the seizure...

00:37:24.420 --> 00:37:30.430
So that means thinking she's odd-eyed 
or has an artificial eye was a mistake on our part?

00:37:24.420 --> 00:37:30.430
So that means thinking she's odd-eyed 
or has an artificial eye was a mistake on our part?

00:37:30.430 --> 00:37:33.270
I wanted to inform you just in case.

00:37:34.460 --> 00:37:35.730
Excuse us.

00:37:35.730 --> 00:37:38.400
We've finished preparing 
her for the transfer.

00:37:38.400 --> 00:37:40.400
Then, we'll also take our leave.

00:37:40.400 --> 00:37:41.070
Okay.

00:37:41.070 --> 00:37:43.110
Thank you.

00:37:44.950 --> 00:37:45.990
Huh?

00:37:45.990 --> 00:37:48.700
Aren't you going with them, kid?

00:37:48.700 --> 00:37:49.320
Nope.

00:37:49.320 --> 00:37:52.270
There's just one more thing 
I wanted to ask you, Doctor.

00:37:52.270 --> 00:37:53.250
What is it?

00:37:53.250 --> 00:37:56.250
It's about the colored 
contact lens from earlier...

00:37:56.250 --> 00:37:59.230
Since it only made 
one eye seem black...

00:37:59.230 --> 00:38:02.210
That means both of her eyes 
were originally blue, right?

00:38:02.210 --> 00:38:05.760
Well actually, 
her right eye is transparent.

00:38:05.760 --> 00:38:06.380
Transparent?!

00:38:06.380 --> 00:38:10.510
Perhaps it's more precise 
for me to say that it "looks transparent".

00:38:10.510 --> 00:38:12.600
It's very rare, actually.

00:38:12.600 --> 00:38:18.900
I believe her eye appears transparent because her iris has almost the same color as her sclera.

00:38:18.900 --> 00:38:24.280
So that doesn't change the fact that 
her left and right pupils have different colors.

00:38:18.900 --> 00:38:24.280
So that doesn't change the fact that 
her left and right pupils have different colors.

00:38:20.630 --> 00:38:22.690
That might have been 
too hard for you.

00:38:22.690 --> 00:38:25.110
To put it more simply...

00:38:25.110 --> 00:38:25.900
Doctor.

00:38:27.130 --> 00:38:29.530
Thank you for everything 
you've done for us today.

00:38:29.530 --> 00:38:30.620
Oh? 
You're done already?

00:38:30.620 --> 00:38:32.870
Yep! Bye!

00:38:32.870 --> 00:38:34.250
All right, take care.

00:38:34.250 --> 00:38:35.060
Is it this room?!

00:38:35.060 --> 00:38:36.040
Huh?

00:38:36.040 --> 00:38:38.890
Is this where my client is?

00:38:38.890 --> 00:38:40.260
Sir, stop.

00:38:40.260 --> 00:38:42.710
Entry to this area is forbidden 
except to those with authorization!

00:38:42.710 --> 00:38:46.860
And I'm telling you 
I have authorization!

00:38:46.860 --> 00:38:48.220
Uncle Kogoro!

00:38:48.220 --> 00:38:48.970
Huh?

00:38:48.970 --> 00:38:50.470
What are you doing here?

00:38:50.470 --> 00:38:52.470
Good timing, brat!

00:38:52.470 --> 00:38:55.840
Where's my beautiful client?

00:38:55.840 --> 00:38:56.960
She isn't here anymore.

00:38:58.300 --> 00:39:01.480
She was transferred 
to a police hospital earlier.

00:39:01.480 --> 00:39:04.070
Besides, she's not a client.

00:39:04.070 --> 00:39:04.940
What?!

00:39:04.940 --> 00:39:08.110
I'm sure you didn't listen 
to what Ran-neechan was telling you.

00:39:09.230 --> 00:39:11.410
Do you still have 
other business here?

00:39:11.410 --> 00:39:13.080
A-Ah, no.

00:39:20.680 --> 00:39:21.500
I wonder what happened.

00:39:21.500 --> 00:39:23.210
No idea.

00:39:23.210 --> 00:39:25.670
I thought she was 
behaving strangely.

00:39:25.670 --> 00:39:28.010
Turns out she has amnesia.

00:39:28.010 --> 00:39:30.760
And where is she now?

00:39:30.760 --> 00:39:33.350
<i>She's being taken to a police hospital.</i>

00:39:33.350 --> 00:39:36.010
So, the police have 
also started moving?

00:39:36.010 --> 00:39:37.160
Yes.

00:39:37.160 --> 00:39:39.180
And there's one thing 
that's bothering me.

00:39:39.180 --> 00:39:40.440
What?

00:39:40.440 --> 00:39:45.110
It seems she had a seizure
 while she was on the Ferris wheel.

00:39:45.110 --> 00:39:46.150
<i>A seizure?</i>

00:39:46.150 --> 00:39:46.780
Yes.

00:39:46.780 --> 00:39:48.240
Got it.

00:39:48.240 --> 00:39:50.400
Keep monitoring her.

00:39:50.400 --> 00:39:51.530
<i>Roger.</i>

00:39:52.530 --> 00:39:54.450
A seizure on a Ferris wheel...

00:39:54.450 --> 00:39:56.120
It can't be...

00:39:57.140 --> 00:40:00.660
Why does Haibara 
hate that lady so much?

00:40:00.660 --> 00:40:02.050
You've got a point.

00:40:02.050 --> 00:40:04.130
I've never seen 
her that angry before.

00:40:04.130 --> 00:40:07.500
Do you know why 
she was angry, Professor?

00:40:07.500 --> 00:40:09.460
Yeah, about that...

00:40:09.460 --> 00:40:13.550
When I tried asking her why, 
she just said she didn't feel well and left.

00:40:13.550 --> 00:40:16.850
It's no use asking him, Ayumi-chan.

00:40:16.850 --> 00:40:18.060
Yeah.

00:40:18.060 --> 00:40:20.810
She always gets 
mad at the professor.

00:40:20.810 --> 00:40:22.190
Yeah, you're right.

00:40:23.490 --> 00:40:24.730
Oh, right!

00:40:24.730 --> 00:40:27.690
Conan-kun asked me 
to hold on to this.

00:40:27.690 --> 00:40:28.530
Ah!

00:40:28.530 --> 00:40:29.860
Isn't that...

00:40:29.860 --> 00:40:32.700
One of the figures 
you can win at the darts booth?

00:40:33.610 --> 00:40:35.950
But why isn't it colored?

00:40:36.910 --> 00:40:40.040
Conan-kun said something 
about that, but I forgot.

00:40:40.040 --> 00:40:40.860
What...?

00:40:40.860 --> 00:40:43.170
Forget it. 
We'll ask him directly.

00:40:44.420 --> 00:40:45.490
Who could this be?

00:40:45.980 --> 00:40:48.880
Oh, speak of the devil. 
It's Conan-kun.

00:40:49.690 --> 00:40:50.590
Hello?

00:40:50.590 --> 00:40:53.430
Professor, 
are the kids still with you?

00:40:53.430 --> 00:40:56.850
<i>Yeah, we just finished 
drinking our tea at Poirot.</i>

00:40:56.850 --> 00:40:59.640
There's something I want to ask you, 
as well as a favor I need your help with.

00:40:59.640 --> 00:41:02.350
<i>First off, 
is that woman okay?</i>

00:41:02.350 --> 00:41:06.610
Yeah, she was transferred 
to the police hospital earlier.

00:41:07.250 --> 00:41:08.360
<i>She'll be fine now.</i>

00:41:08.360 --> 00:41:09.520
I'm glad to hear that!

00:41:09.520 --> 00:41:12.190
And what is this favor 
you wanted to ask me for?

00:41:09.680 --> 00:41:11.530
We have to go visit her.

00:41:11.530 --> 00:41:12.190
You're right.

00:41:12.190 --> 00:41:16.450
<i>I'd like you to recover the internal data 
from the phone she had on her.</i>

00:41:16.450 --> 00:41:20.950
I don't mind, but don't expect me to be able to do a full data recovery.

00:41:20.950 --> 00:41:21.950
Yeah, I know.

00:41:21.950 --> 00:41:26.290
Also, she apparently said something when she was having a seizure on the Ferris wheel.

00:41:26.290 --> 00:41:27.330
<i>Also, she apparently said something when she was having a seizure on the Ferris wheel.</i>

00:41:27.330 --> 00:41:28.960
<i>I want to know what she said.</i>

00:41:28.960 --> 00:41:33.550
Oh, I wrote that down in my notepad, 
though it was from only partway through.

00:41:33.550 --> 00:41:35.010
Let's see...

00:41:35.010 --> 00:41:40.930
She said 
"Stout, Aquavit, and Riesling".

00:41:41.540 --> 00:41:43.230
<i>What could that've meant?</i>

00:41:42.320 --> 00:41:43.600
Names of alcoholic beverages?!

00:41:42.320 --> 00:41:43.600
Names of alcoholic beverages?!

00:41:43.230 --> 00:41:44.890
<i>Does that make any 
sense to you, Conan-kun?</i>

00:41:43.600 --> 00:41:44.890
Don't tell me she's—

00:41:43.600 --> 00:41:44.890
Don't tell me she's—

00:41:47.060 --> 00:41:47.940
Huh?

00:41:47.940 --> 00:41:49.020
Y-Yeah...

00:41:49.020 --> 00:41:50.730
<i>Then put Amuro-san on!</i>

00:41:51.940 --> 00:41:53.690
Amuro-san?

00:41:53.690 --> 00:41:56.150
Come to think of it, 
I haven't seen him today.

00:41:56.150 --> 00:41:58.740
If you're looking for Amuro-san,
 he's taken the day off.

00:41:58.740 --> 00:41:59.370
What?

00:41:59.370 --> 00:42:04.040
He called this morning, suddenly asked to be excused for the day, then hung up.

00:42:04.040 --> 00:42:09.280
I tried calling him back many times after, 
but I'm a little worried because I couldn't reach him.

00:42:09.280 --> 00:42:10.790
You heard what she said.

00:42:10.790 --> 00:42:12.750
<i>I hope nothing's happned to him...</i>

00:42:12.750 --> 00:42:14.170
<i>I'm a little worried.</i>

00:42:15.800 --> 00:42:19.550
Amuro-san, don't tell me...

00:42:35.460 --> 00:42:36.440
Stout here.

00:42:36.440 --> 00:42:37.740
I am on the bus.

00:42:37.740 --> 00:42:40.170
<i>Await further instructions.</i>

00:42:40.170 --> 00:42:41.160
Roger that.

00:42:51.010 --> 00:42:52.380
Stout...

00:42:52.380 --> 00:42:55.460
I believed in you.

00:42:55.460 --> 00:42:56.720
What a shame.

00:42:58.650 --> 00:43:00.260
Stout is dead.

00:43:00.260 --> 00:43:02.390
<i>Okay. 
Come back at once.</i>

00:43:02.390 --> 00:43:03.220
Understood.

00:43:10.350 --> 00:43:15.610
For 32 years, the CN Tower 
was the tallest building in the world.

00:43:15.610 --> 00:43:21.110
The EdgeWalk takes you all around 
the 116th floor of the tower.

00:43:21.960 --> 00:43:26.750
Putting you 356 meters 
above the ground!

00:43:26.750 --> 00:43:28.960
Now, then, does anybody want—

00:43:27.760 --> 00:43:29.710
Look at the helicopter, man!

00:43:31.010 --> 00:43:32.130
That helicopter...

00:43:32.130 --> 00:43:33.460
It can't be...

00:43:48.390 --> 00:43:49.560
He had it coming.

00:43:49.560 --> 00:43:52.270
This is a befitting death for a spy.

00:43:53.410 --> 00:43:55.320
I eliminated Aquavit.

00:43:55.320 --> 00:43:57.720
<i>I expected no less from you. 
Come back at once.</i>

00:43:58.510 --> 00:44:00.400
I'd do that, even 
without you telling me to.

00:44:09.260 --> 00:44:11.830
Come on, how long 
do you plan on dragging this out?

00:44:11.830 --> 00:44:14.710
I know I told you that 
you only have one minute.

00:44:15.250 --> 00:44:17.810
And I already told you, 
I'm no NOC!

00:44:17.810 --> 00:44:20.720
Then let's make this black and white.

00:44:24.150 --> 00:44:26.970
Shall we, Riesling?

00:44:27.620 --> 00:44:28.310
Gin...

00:44:28.310 --> 00:44:33.100
Let's make the distinction between our side and your side perfectly clear.

00:44:34.380 --> 00:44:39.190
Besides you, spill the names of the other rats that squirmed their way in!

00:44:40.060 --> 00:44:41.400
Spill them, already!

00:44:41.400 --> 00:44:42.700
You don't want to 
suffer a lot of pain, do you?

00:44:42.700 --> 00:44:44.880
Don't make me 
keep repeating myself!

00:44:44.880 --> 00:44:46.120
I'm not a NOC!

00:44:46.120 --> 00:44:47.700
It's no use threatening me, Gin!

00:44:48.550 --> 00:44:49.660
Threaten?

00:44:49.660 --> 00:44:52.790
You think I'd do 
something cutesy like that?

00:44:53.730 --> 00:44:55.630
Five...

00:44:55.630 --> 00:44:56.460
Four...

00:44:57.470 --> 00:44:59.050
Three...

00:44:59.050 --> 00:44:59.800
Two...

00:45:01.300 --> 00:45:02.800
One...

00:45:02.800 --> 00:45:03.800
Zero!

00:45:22.070 --> 00:45:23.900
Let's go, hurry!

00:45:24.880 --> 00:45:25.810
Where to?

00:45:25.810 --> 00:45:27.070
Japan.

00:45:27.070 --> 00:45:28.070
No way!

00:45:28.980 --> 00:45:30.410
Only two are left.

00:45:37.580 --> 00:45:39.970
An MI6 agent from 
the United Kingdom...

00:45:39.970 --> 00:45:43.340
A CSIS agent from Canada, 
and a BND agent from Germany.

00:45:43.340 --> 00:45:47.260
Intelligence operatives from different countries 
were assassinated one after the other.

00:45:47.260 --> 00:45:48.490
What?!
You don't mean...

00:45:48.490 --> 00:45:48.970
Yes.

00:45:48.970 --> 00:45:53.310
The one thing they have in common is 
that they all had infiltrated a certain Organization.

00:45:53.310 --> 00:45:56.250
So it was those men in black 
that finished them off?!

00:45:56.250 --> 00:46:00.910
A spy working for the Organization may have stolen data from the National Police Agency.

00:46:00.910 --> 00:46:03.690
We received a report 
from Akai-san stating as much.

00:46:04.620 --> 00:46:07.070
A spy working for the Organization...

00:46:04.620 --> 00:46:07.070
A spy working for the Organization...

00:46:07.070 --> 00:46:07.990
Jodie-sensei...

00:46:07.990 --> 00:46:10.040
The reason you called me here...

00:46:10.040 --> 00:46:13.790
Is because I came in contact with the person believed to be the spy, isn't it?

00:46:13.790 --> 00:46:14.750
Yes.

00:46:14.750 --> 00:46:15.960
I thought so.

00:46:15.960 --> 00:46:18.380
But she has amnesia...

00:46:18.380 --> 00:46:21.130
And the smartphone she could 
have used as flash memory was broken.

00:46:21.130 --> 00:46:22.340
A smartphone?!

00:46:22.340 --> 00:46:24.510
She had one with her?

00:46:24.510 --> 00:46:25.380
Yeah.

00:46:25.380 --> 00:46:28.010
She left it on a bench 
unattended, so I held onto it.

00:46:28.010 --> 00:46:31.300
In that case, it'd be best to send it to the FBI headquarters for data analysis.

00:46:31.300 --> 00:46:31.760
Yeah.

00:46:31.760 --> 00:46:32.890
I agree.

00:46:32.890 --> 00:46:33.850
Wait.

00:46:33.850 --> 00:46:36.680
The professor said he's just 
about able to restore the data...

00:46:36.680 --> 00:46:38.810
So it'd be faster 
to have him keep going at it.

00:46:38.810 --> 00:46:42.020
Then I'd like you to let us know 
once the data analysis is done.

00:46:42.020 --> 00:46:46.490
Unless we grasp just how much information 
has been leaked as soon as possible...

00:46:46.490 --> 00:46:49.160
The whole world 
will plunge into panic.

00:46:50.100 --> 00:46:52.030
What sort of data was stolen?

00:46:52.030 --> 00:46:53.620
Non-Official Cover.

00:46:54.900 --> 00:46:55.620
You don't mean...

00:46:55.620 --> 00:46:57.790
Yes, the NOC list.

00:46:57.790 --> 00:47:01.460
It's a list of spies from all over the world 
that the National Police Agency has.

00:47:01.460 --> 00:47:06.730
That means all the spies who infiltrated 
the Organization will be eliminated?

00:47:06.730 --> 00:47:08.590
Not just them.

00:47:08.590 --> 00:47:10.660
If the NOC list was made public...

00:47:10.660 --> 00:47:13.760
Intelligence agencies from all 
over the world might be brought to ruin.

00:47:13.760 --> 00:47:19.100
So you're saying those guys obtained the key to start an intelligence war?

00:47:19.100 --> 00:47:20.440
Yes.

00:47:20.440 --> 00:47:28.320
Which means the three recent assassinations 
may only be the beginning.

00:47:35.950 --> 00:47:38.120
We've really made it here.

00:47:38.120 --> 00:47:42.210
But is it really okay to have kept this 
a secret from Ai-chan and Conan-kun?

00:47:42.210 --> 00:47:43.290
It's fine!

00:47:43.290 --> 00:47:46.340
If we told them, 
they'd just say "Absolutely not!"

00:47:46.340 --> 00:47:48.300
For now, let's try going in.

00:47:48.300 --> 00:47:50.130
I don't know whether 
they'll let us see her, though.

00:47:50.130 --> 00:47:50.970
Yeah!

00:47:50.970 --> 00:47:52.590
Yes.

00:47:52.590 --> 00:47:53.720
Yes, that's right.

00:47:53.720 --> 00:47:55.850
It's the Touto Police Hospital.

00:47:55.850 --> 00:47:57.970
If it comes down to it, 
do what you have to.

00:47:57.970 --> 00:47:59.890
I'm counting on you, Kazami.

00:47:59.890 --> 00:48:00.640
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:48:08.900 --> 00:48:11.910
Bourbon, 
what are you doing here?

00:48:11.910 --> 00:48:14.910
I'm here to take 
her back, of course.

00:48:15.900 --> 00:48:20.290
And here I thought you came here to
shut her up before her memory returns.

00:48:20.290 --> 00:48:22.790
Why would I do that?

00:48:22.790 --> 00:48:25.670
I can't grasp 
what you're trying to say.

00:48:25.670 --> 00:48:28.460
Then how do you 
plan to approach her?

00:48:28.460 --> 00:48:32.220
She's strictly guarded 
and isn't allowed any visitors.

00:48:32.220 --> 00:48:36.050
Or is it that you can meet her 
with no trouble at all?

00:48:36.050 --> 00:48:40.180
Maybe you have a special
 connection to the police or something.

00:48:40.180 --> 00:48:43.480
What have you been 
implying all this time?

00:48:43.480 --> 00:48:44.940
Never mind.

00:48:44.940 --> 00:48:46.860
Standing around here talking isn't wise.

00:48:46.860 --> 00:48:48.570
Let's go somewhere else.

00:48:50.060 --> 00:48:54.320
If that's an order from the Organization, then I have no choice but to oblige.

00:48:58.330 --> 00:48:59.420
How'd it go?

00:48:59.420 --> 00:49:00.500
It was no good.

00:49:00.500 --> 00:49:02.210
Looks like no one 
is allowed to visit her.

00:49:02.210 --> 00:49:03.720
Seriously?!

00:49:03.720 --> 00:49:05.750
Is her condition that bad?

00:49:05.750 --> 00:49:08.670
We'll have to look into this.

00:49:08.670 --> 00:49:10.670
Oh, but how?

00:49:10.670 --> 00:49:11.690
With this!

00:49:12.100 --> 00:49:13.090
I see!

00:49:13.090 --> 00:49:16.090
That's right!
We have our strong ally!

00:49:23.000 --> 00:49:24.390
Professor!

00:49:24.390 --> 00:49:26.230
How's the 
data restoration going?

00:49:26.230 --> 00:49:30.400
If it's just the latest sent data,
 it looks like I can manage to recover it.

00:49:30.400 --> 00:49:31.990
Okay, please hurry.

00:49:31.990 --> 00:49:33.320
I-I will.

00:49:33.320 --> 00:49:36.070
How about this?

00:49:36.070 --> 00:49:38.660
Genta-kun, 
you can't put a piece there.

00:49:38.660 --> 00:49:40.830
I can't? 
Oops, my mistake.

00:49:40.830 --> 00:49:41.380
Oh?

00:49:41.380 --> 00:49:42.330
Detective Takagi!

00:49:42.330 --> 00:49:44.520
You're right! 
He's finally back!

00:49:44.520 --> 00:49:45.390
How's the lady?

00:49:45.390 --> 00:49:47.000
Does it sound like we can see her?

00:49:47.000 --> 00:49:48.580
Keep quiet.

00:49:48.580 --> 00:49:50.780
Because it's a secret 
that I brought you in here.

00:49:50.800 --> 00:49:52.670
Who are you 
keeping it secret from?

00:49:52.670 --> 00:49:53.970
Oh, sorry.

00:49:53.970 --> 00:49:55.590
I said that out of habit, 
since that's how it usually is.

00:49:55.590 --> 00:49:57.220
Oh, Miss!

00:49:57.220 --> 00:49:59.470
I'm so glad you seem okay!

00:49:59.470 --> 00:50:01.470
Does your head not hurt anymore?

00:50:01.470 --> 00:50:02.520
Yeah.

00:50:02.520 --> 00:50:03.930
I'm fine now.

00:50:03.930 --> 00:50:05.270
Thank you.

00:50:05.270 --> 00:50:08.810
Under normal circumstances, 
we must not let anyone see her.

00:50:08.810 --> 00:50:15.360
But since she seems to trust you kids, 
we thought it might help her regain her memory.

00:50:15.360 --> 00:50:16.200
Really?

00:50:15.540 --> 00:50:17.110
Yay!

00:50:16.450 --> 00:50:17.660
Thank you!

00:50:17.660 --> 00:50:21.330
However, you may only be here 
until the start of the next investigation.

00:50:21.330 --> 00:50:22.950
Okay!

00:50:24.460 --> 00:50:25.470
There!

00:50:26.540 --> 00:50:28.960
Where should I make my next move?

00:50:28.960 --> 00:50:30.170
Let me see.

00:50:30.170 --> 00:50:31.500
How about right here?

00:50:31.500 --> 00:50:32.800
Okay!

00:50:34.240 --> 00:50:35.050
What do you think of that?!

00:50:35.050 --> 00:50:36.970
What should we do now?

00:50:36.970 --> 00:50:38.430
They got us good.

00:50:38.430 --> 00:50:40.220
We did it, Miss!

00:50:39.350 --> 00:50:40.220
What can we do?

00:50:40.220 --> 00:50:41.220
Yeah, we did.

00:50:41.220 --> 00:50:43.180
Oh, right.

00:50:43.840 --> 00:50:45.740
Here, this is for you.

00:50:45.740 --> 00:50:46.100
What?

00:50:46.100 --> 00:50:47.940
But this is...

00:50:47.940 --> 00:50:50.730
The man from the darts 
booth gave it to us afterwards.

00:50:50.730 --> 00:50:53.070
He said you can paint it 
with whichever color you like.

00:50:53.070 --> 00:50:55.490
Is it really okay 
for me to have it?

00:50:55.490 --> 00:50:59.530
Yeah!
You saved my life, after all!

00:50:59.530 --> 00:51:01.070
Miss.

00:51:01.070 --> 00:51:03.200
Now we all have matching ones.

00:51:03.200 --> 00:51:04.080
We do.

00:51:04.080 --> 00:51:06.500
What color do you 
want to paint it, Miss?

00:51:06.500 --> 00:51:07.750
Red? Pink?

00:51:07.750 --> 00:51:10.750
If it were me, 
I'd paint it black like an orca.

00:51:10.750 --> 00:51:14.340
But I think white suits 
you better than black.

00:51:14.340 --> 00:51:15.980
Your hair is white...

00:51:15.980 --> 00:51:17.920
And if you go with white, 
you can leave it as is...

00:51:17.920 --> 00:51:19.050
Which would make it a great deal.

00:51:19.050 --> 00:51:21.510
Genta-kun, 
what you just said is wrong.

00:51:21.510 --> 00:51:23.510
You're making it sound like 
a bargain she found during a sale.

00:51:23.510 --> 00:51:25.630
That's fine, 
don't you think?

00:51:29.440 --> 00:51:30.650
Are you okay, Genta-kun?

00:51:31.660 --> 00:51:33.270
Yeah, my bad.

00:51:33.270 --> 00:51:34.900
Are you all okay?

00:51:34.900 --> 00:51:35.920
Yeah.

00:51:35.920 --> 00:51:36.610
Oh, man!

00:51:36.610 --> 00:51:38.740
I was just winning, too!

00:51:38.740 --> 00:51:41.000
Isn't that only 
because of the lady?!

00:51:41.000 --> 00:51:41.610
What?

00:51:41.610 --> 00:51:44.990
You didn't do anything but 
follow her instructions, did you?

00:51:44.990 --> 00:51:46.790
Yeah, pretty much.

00:51:47.950 --> 00:51:49.120
Excuse me.

00:51:49.120 --> 00:51:49.750
Huh?

00:51:51.120 --> 00:51:53.130
I'm Kazami, 
from Public Security.

00:51:53.130 --> 00:51:56.130
I heard the person in 
charge here is Inspector Megure.

00:51:57.060 --> 00:51:58.920
Are you Inspector Megure?

00:51:58.920 --> 00:52:01.590
Indeed, I am Megure.

00:52:01.590 --> 00:52:05.180
We want you to hand over that woman over there without delay.

00:52:05.180 --> 00:52:06.510
Why?

00:52:06.510 --> 00:52:09.430
We should also have 
authority for investigating.

00:52:09.430 --> 00:52:12.810
This woman is suspected of having 
infiltrated the National Police Agency.

00:52:12.810 --> 00:52:16.570
We need to hear her 
motive for that immediately.

00:52:16.570 --> 00:52:18.770
If you've grasped the situation...

00:52:18.770 --> 00:52:22.070
I'd like you to begin the preparations 
to hand her over right away.

00:52:22.070 --> 00:52:25.410
You don't have the 
authority to deny my request.

00:52:27.560 --> 00:52:29.080
Understood.

00:52:29.080 --> 00:52:31.000
This way, please.

00:52:31.000 --> 00:52:32.960
I have already 
prepared the application.

00:52:34.460 --> 00:52:36.960
What's going to 
happen to you, Miss?

00:52:36.960 --> 00:52:37.960
Who knows?

00:52:37.960 --> 00:52:40.670
Okay, this is the 
end of your visit with her.

00:52:40.670 --> 00:52:41.970
Please go home, you guys.

00:52:43.410 --> 00:52:46.260
Come, let's get you back 
to your hospital room now.

00:52:46.260 --> 00:52:46.890
Okay.

00:52:46.890 --> 00:52:48.220
Oh, Miss!

00:52:48.220 --> 00:52:49.600
You're leaving?

00:52:51.220 --> 00:52:51.980
Miss!

00:52:53.520 --> 00:52:54.940
Thank you, guys.

00:52:54.940 --> 00:52:56.860
I'll cherish this.

00:52:57.700 --> 00:52:59.030
Okay.

00:52:59.030 --> 00:53:02.360
Let's all ride the Ferris wheel 
together again someday.

00:53:02.360 --> 00:53:02.860
Yeah!

00:53:02.860 --> 00:53:03.770
That's a promise!

00:53:03.770 --> 00:53:04.360
We'll all ride with you!

00:53:04.360 --> 00:53:06.570
Now, let's go.

00:53:13.550 --> 00:53:15.560
Is she going to be okay?

00:53:15.560 --> 00:53:17.500
I know... 
I'm worried, too.

00:53:17.500 --> 00:53:18.630
Yeah.

00:53:20.940 --> 00:53:22.510
Oh, Shinichi.

00:53:22.510 --> 00:53:24.130
The data analysis is done.

00:53:24.130 --> 00:53:25.430
And what did you find?

00:53:26.380 --> 00:53:26.840
Look.

00:53:27.790 --> 00:53:31.080
"The NOCs are 
Stout, Aquavit, and Riesling."

00:53:31.080 --> 00:53:32.850
"The two whom you doubted..."

00:53:32.850 --> 00:53:34.440
"Bourbon and Kir"?!

00:53:34.440 --> 00:53:36.440
Damn it! 
So it's just like I thought!

00:53:36.440 --> 00:53:40.110
Professor, please analyze who that 
message was being sent to as soon as possible!

00:53:40.110 --> 00:53:40.940
O-Okay.

00:53:40.940 --> 00:53:42.110
Give me a call 
as soon as you have it!

00:53:47.620 --> 00:53:49.240
Haibara...

00:53:50.370 --> 00:53:51.930
Don't go...

00:53:51.930 --> 00:53:52.620
Please.

00:53:55.010 --> 00:53:56.920
I've told you this before.

00:53:56.920 --> 00:53:59.630
"Don't run from your fate."

00:54:00.870 --> 00:54:02.550
I don't wanna run from mine, either.

00:54:12.190 --> 00:54:13.640
Kudo-kun...

00:54:13.830 --> 00:54:15.850
Thank you, Detective Takagi.

00:54:15.850 --> 00:54:18.150
Sorry for being so unreasonable.

00:54:18.150 --> 00:54:20.830
It's okay.
You get home safe, now.

00:54:20.830 --> 00:54:21.730
Okay.

00:54:23.150 --> 00:54:25.840
Cheer up, Genta-kun.

00:54:25.840 --> 00:54:27.950
I'm sure we'll see her again.

00:54:27.950 --> 00:54:29.280
But...

00:54:29.280 --> 00:54:30.370
Oh, yeah!

00:54:30.370 --> 00:54:33.200
Why don't we go ride 
the Ferris wheel now?

00:54:33.200 --> 00:54:34.290
Yeah!

00:54:34.290 --> 00:54:36.620
And the lady 
wanted to ride it again, too...

00:54:36.620 --> 00:54:39.080
So let's take pictures of 
the scenery and send it to her!

00:54:39.080 --> 00:54:42.010
If we left now, 
it'll be night by the time we get there...

00:54:42.010 --> 00:54:44.840
And we might not be able 
to ride because of the long line.

00:54:44.840 --> 00:54:46.420
Don't worry.

00:54:46.420 --> 00:54:50.590
I'm sure the Suzuki Financial Group has invested funds into the Touto Aquarium...

00:54:50.590 --> 00:54:51.890
So here.

00:54:53.140 --> 00:54:53.970
Oh, I see!

00:54:54.160 --> 00:54:57.730
That's right! 
We have one other strong ally!

00:54:59.490 --> 00:55:02.360
It seems you 
suspect us of being NOCs.

00:55:02.360 --> 00:55:09.570
Both of your names were on the
 NOC list we received from Curaçao.

00:55:09.570 --> 00:55:10.870
Curaçao...

00:55:10.870 --> 00:55:12.530
Rum's confidant?

00:55:12.530 --> 00:55:13.580
Yes.

00:55:13.580 --> 00:55:15.540
She's a specialist 
in gathering information.

00:55:15.540 --> 00:55:17.330
Seems like you 
already know about her.

00:55:17.330 --> 00:55:20.800
Her distinguishing characteristic is that 
her left and right eyes are different colors...

00:55:20.800 --> 00:55:21.830
That is, she's odd-eyed.

00:55:21.830 --> 00:55:24.170
Everyone in the Organization's 
heard the story about her.

00:55:24.170 --> 00:55:29.340
For old times sake, we'll give you 
painless deaths if you're honest and confess.

00:55:30.060 --> 00:55:31.970
The reason you captured us 
rather than assassinating us...

00:55:31.970 --> 00:55:35.970
Is because the info you got 
from Curaçao was incomplete.

00:55:35.970 --> 00:55:37.220
Am I wrong?

00:55:38.480 --> 00:55:40.600
You're as shrewd as ever, Bourbon.

00:55:40.600 --> 00:55:43.710
Everything went smoothly 
up until she stole the NOC list...

00:55:43.710 --> 00:55:47.360
But then she was found by the police 
and got into an accident as she was trying to get away.

00:55:47.360 --> 00:55:49.990
And to make things worse,
 she now suffers from amnesia.

00:55:49.990 --> 00:55:54.950
Then shouldn't you go recover Curaçao 
and get a hold of the NOC list?!

00:55:54.950 --> 00:55:55.930
Gin...

00:55:55.930 --> 00:56:00.250
It won't be too late if you wait until after 
you've confirmed whether or not we're really NOCs!

00:56:01.340 --> 00:56:02.710
You're right.

00:56:02.710 --> 00:56:04.090
However...

00:56:08.420 --> 00:56:09.040
Gin!

00:56:09.040 --> 00:56:09.800
Bro?!

00:56:09.800 --> 00:56:12.050
You're guilty 
until proven innocent.

00:56:12.050 --> 00:56:15.050
Because that's how I operate.

00:56:15.050 --> 00:56:16.560
Now...

00:56:17.600 --> 00:56:20.640
It's time to exact 
judgment on you traitors!

00:56:21.910 --> 00:56:23.100
Aren't you done yet, Professor?

00:56:23.100 --> 00:56:24.650
<i>Don't be impatient.</i>

00:56:24.650 --> 00:56:26.980
<i>The data analysis 
will be done in 30 seconds.</i>

00:56:26.980 --> 00:56:27.610
Okay...

00:56:27.610 --> 00:56:31.010
<i>Once you've uncovered the address,
 do what I told you earlier!</i>

00:56:31.010 --> 00:56:32.030
Right.

00:56:32.030 --> 00:56:33.910
I just need to send a message...

00:56:33.910 --> 00:56:36.530
And make it appear to have come from this broken smartphone, right?

00:56:36.530 --> 00:56:37.950
<i>Yes, and please hurry!</i>

00:56:37.950 --> 00:56:39.450
<i>We have no time to waste!</i>

00:56:39.450 --> 00:56:41.210
Oh, it's done!

00:56:42.210 --> 00:56:43.580
He hung up...

00:56:49.680 --> 00:56:51.170
Over here, Cool Kid!

00:56:52.650 --> 00:56:54.550
For now, just read this.

00:56:56.680 --> 00:56:58.060
I-Is this...?!

00:57:01.810 --> 00:57:02.730
Kir!

00:57:04.770 --> 00:57:06.480
What's the matter, Kir?

00:57:06.480 --> 00:57:07.940
Continue what you were doing!

00:57:09.220 --> 00:57:10.940
You want to take 
the handcuffs off, don't you?

00:57:10.940 --> 00:57:12.780
You'd shoot your own 
solely on the grounds of suspicion?!

00:57:14.460 --> 00:57:17.700
You're not the ones who
 decide whether you're one of us.

00:57:17.700 --> 00:57:20.950
I reprieve your judgment 
for just one last minute.

00:57:20.950 --> 00:57:24.960
I'll pay respect to the one of you 
who sells the other out first...

00:57:24.960 --> 00:57:27.600
By letting them 
watch a rat bite the dust.

00:57:29.100 --> 00:57:31.260
Vodka, start counting.

00:57:31.260 --> 00:57:32.420
Roger.

00:57:33.790 --> 00:57:34.510
60 seconds...

00:57:37.320 --> 00:57:39.010
You think you'll get to me 
with those threats?!

00:57:39.700 --> 00:57:43.770
If I said she's a NOC, that would be the same as acknowledging I am a NOC myself.

00:57:43.770 --> 00:57:46.480
You wouldn't let someone
 like that get away unpunished.

00:57:46.480 --> 00:57:47.150
50 seconds...

00:57:47.150 --> 00:57:49.770
Heh. 
How about you?

00:57:49.770 --> 00:57:52.280
I can be surprisingly kind...

00:57:52.280 --> 00:57:53.280
Kir.

00:57:55.170 --> 00:57:56.110
40 seconds...

00:57:58.740 --> 00:58:01.790
So you two get along well, 
and will cover for each other, huh?

00:58:01.790 --> 00:58:03.730
I'm not covering for her at all.

00:58:03.730 --> 00:58:06.400
I don't know whether she's a NOC.

00:58:06.400 --> 00:58:07.300
Same here!

00:58:07.300 --> 00:58:08.330
30 seconds.

00:58:08.330 --> 00:58:09.260
But I can say this:

00:58:09.260 --> 00:58:10.790
I am not a NOC!

00:58:10.790 --> 00:58:12.670
That's my line!

00:58:12.670 --> 00:58:13.800
Now...

00:58:13.800 --> 00:58:15.010
20 seconds!

00:58:15.010 --> 00:58:16.800
Which one of you is the rat?

00:58:16.800 --> 00:58:17.740
Gin...

00:58:17.740 --> 00:58:19.050
Don't tell me 
you're actually serious...?

00:58:19.600 --> 00:58:22.060
Which one of you 
is going to squeal first?

00:58:22.060 --> 00:58:22.850
Ten seconds...

00:58:22.850 --> 00:58:23.560
Nine...

00:58:23.560 --> 00:58:25.060
Eight...

00:58:25.060 --> 00:58:25.810
Will it be...

00:58:25.060 --> 00:58:25.810
Seven...

00:58:25.810 --> 00:58:26.810
Bourbon?

00:58:25.810 --> 00:58:26.810
Six...

00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:27.810
Or Kir?

00:58:27.000 --> 00:58:27.810
Five...

00:58:27.810 --> 00:58:29.060
Four...

00:58:29.060 --> 00:58:29.770
Three...

00:58:29.770 --> 00:58:30.270
Two...

00:58:30.270 --> 00:58:32.070
You're going down first...

00:58:30.840 --> 00:58:32.070
One...

00:58:32.250 --> 00:58:33.150
Zero!

00:58:33.150 --> 00:58:34.400
Bourbon!

00:58:51.360 --> 00:58:52.670
What? 
What happened?

00:58:52.670 --> 00:58:53.420
T-The lights!

00:58:53.420 --> 00:58:54.760
Kir! Bourbon!

00:58:54.760 --> 00:58:55.840
Don't you dare move!

00:58:58.490 --> 00:58:59.890
B-Bourbon's gone!

00:58:59.890 --> 00:59:01.140
He escaped!

00:59:01.140 --> 00:59:01.760
Damn.

00:59:01.760 --> 00:59:03.310
How'd he do it?!

00:59:05.930 --> 00:59:06.600
After him!

00:59:12.770 --> 00:59:14.480
Sorry, Kir.

00:59:14.480 --> 00:59:16.990
I couldn't show you 
the carcass of a rat.

00:59:16.990 --> 00:59:19.320
But there's no need to 
worry about being alone.

00:59:19.320 --> 00:59:23.240
I'll send Bourbon over to you soon.

00:59:23.240 --> 00:59:25.660
Farewell, Kir.

00:59:24.370 --> 00:59:25.660
Gin, wait!

00:59:25.660 --> 00:59:26.950
You can't shoot!

00:59:26.950 --> 00:59:28.290
It's an order from Rum!

00:59:29.400 --> 00:59:31.170
So, what are your orders for us?

00:59:32.090 --> 00:59:33.670
Okay. Copy that.

00:59:35.720 --> 00:59:38.170
It seems he got a 
message from Curaçao...

00:59:39.100 --> 00:59:41.300
Saying the two of them 
were not involved.

00:59:41.300 --> 00:59:43.390
She regained her memory?

00:59:43.390 --> 00:59:48.100
Looks like this has 
cleared us of all suspicion.

00:59:48.100 --> 00:59:51.690
So will you get these 
handcuffs off of me, already?

00:59:51.690 --> 00:59:53.360
You can't!

00:59:53.360 --> 00:59:55.730
There's more to Rum's order.

00:59:55.730 --> 01:00:01.740
He says, "I need you to confirm whether 
the message I received was really sent by Curaçao."

01:00:01.740 --> 01:00:06.790
Though it will probably be an awful lot of trouble 
to recover her from the police hospital.

01:00:06.790 --> 01:00:08.500
That is of no concern.

01:00:08.500 --> 01:00:13.040
If my intuition is right, 
there will be some movement soon.

01:00:17.630 --> 01:00:19.380
Nice timing, Gin.

01:00:19.380 --> 01:00:23.180
The dimwits from Public Security 
finally started making their move.

01:00:23.180 --> 01:00:24.260
<i>Thought so.</i>

01:00:24.260 --> 01:00:27.770
They sure are fools to not 
even know they've been bugged.

01:00:27.770 --> 01:00:29.770
<i>So, where are they headed?</i>

01:00:30.620 --> 01:00:33.020
Right where you had expected.

01:00:33.020 --> 01:00:36.360
They are just about 
to shove her in the car now.

01:00:36.360 --> 01:00:37.780
<i>Get the aircraft ready.</i>

01:00:38.890 --> 01:00:39.570
You can't be serious!

01:00:40.630 --> 01:00:44.910
It's a good chance 
for us to test its power.

01:00:44.910 --> 01:00:48.330
<i>You're not thinking 
of starting a war, are you?</i>

01:00:48.330 --> 01:00:50.120
It's an order from Rum.

01:00:51.160 --> 01:00:53.580
This mission 
absolutely must be a success.

01:00:53.580 --> 01:00:54.580
<i>Roger that.</i>

01:00:56.830 --> 01:00:58.090
Can't take it, can't take it, 
can't take it anymore!

01:00:58.090 --> 01:01:00.670
It feels like this intense excitement 
is gonna make me climax.

01:01:00.670 --> 01:01:02.380
I can't take it, either.

01:01:02.380 --> 01:01:05.340
Gin, are you seriously 
intending to use that?!

01:01:05.340 --> 01:01:06.800
I couldn't find him, Bro.

01:01:06.800 --> 01:01:08.640
He got away.

01:01:08.640 --> 01:01:09.810
Doesn't matter.

01:01:11.300 --> 01:01:13.690
We'll put off eliminating 
Bourbon and Kir.

01:01:13.690 --> 01:01:15.810
Recovering Curaçao comes first.

01:01:15.810 --> 01:01:18.820
But the hospital is swarming with police and Public Security officers.

01:01:18.820 --> 01:01:21.440
Curaçao has already left the hospital.

01:01:21.440 --> 01:01:22.820
Where to, then?

01:01:22.820 --> 01:01:25.300
Our destination is...

01:01:25.300 --> 01:01:26.780
Touto Aquarium.

01:01:26.780 --> 01:01:27.830
Gin!

01:01:27.830 --> 01:01:31.200
Don't tell me you set that up in advance, 
knowing this would happen?

01:01:32.460 --> 01:01:33.710
We're going, Vodka.

01:01:33.710 --> 01:01:34.960
Bring the car around.

01:01:34.960 --> 01:01:35.830
Right!

01:01:38.870 --> 01:01:40.250
Yeah, got it.

01:01:40.250 --> 01:01:42.090
I need you to head 
over there right away.

01:01:42.090 --> 01:01:44.590
We'll perform the rescue.

01:01:44.590 --> 01:01:45.630
<i>Understood.</i>

01:01:45.630 --> 01:01:48.470
It seems that the two of them 
got out of their dilemma.

01:01:48.470 --> 01:01:49.720
Thank goodness.

01:01:49.720 --> 01:01:51.010
Amazing!

01:01:51.010 --> 01:01:53.350
Your plan was a 
huge success, wasn't it, kid?!

01:01:53.350 --> 01:01:55.390
No, it was nothing special.

01:01:55.390 --> 01:01:58.270
That message ended 
in the middle of a sentence...

01:01:58.270 --> 01:02:00.130
So I continued it by adding...

01:02:00.130 --> 01:02:02.320
"You can rest assured 
that neither of them were involved."

01:02:02.320 --> 01:02:04.280
And simply sent that.

01:02:04.280 --> 01:02:06.240
Good, then those two 
are no longer in danger.

01:02:06.240 --> 01:02:06.850
Yeah.

01:02:06.850 --> 01:02:07.530
No.

01:02:07.530 --> 01:02:10.240
This is nothing more 
than a temporary measure.

01:02:10.240 --> 01:02:12.910
The enemy has prioritized 
the recovery of their spy...

01:02:12.910 --> 01:02:15.830
And it seems they're now 
headed to the Touto Aquarium.

01:02:15.830 --> 01:02:17.540
Not the police hospital?!

01:02:17.540 --> 01:02:18.660
Yes...

01:02:18.660 --> 01:02:21.800
She's apparently being lead out and taken to the aquarium by Public Security.

01:02:21.800 --> 01:02:23.050
The aquarium...?

01:02:23.050 --> 01:02:24.260
Then we should go, too...

01:02:24.260 --> 01:02:24.800
No.

01:02:24.800 --> 01:02:27.970
Akai-kun is already on his way there.

01:02:27.970 --> 01:02:32.100
We'll take care of rescuing the undercover agent 
who was left at the warehouse district...

01:02:32.100 --> 01:02:34.000
As well as searching for the NOC list.

01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:34.480
Yes, sir!

01:02:34.480 --> 01:02:37.270
Conan-kun, 
you should get out of the car.

01:02:37.270 --> 01:02:40.150
There's no telling what 
might happen from here on out.

01:02:40.150 --> 01:02:41.020
But...

01:02:41.020 --> 01:02:42.320
It's okay.

01:02:42.320 --> 01:02:45.320
The FBI will definitely settle this.

01:02:46.640 --> 01:02:47.320
Okay.

01:02:49.140 --> 01:02:50.490
I'll leave it to you guys, then.

01:02:50.490 --> 01:02:51.490
Yeah.

01:02:51.490 --> 01:02:53.490
We'll contact you once it's over.

01:02:54.750 --> 01:02:56.250
Oh, come to think of it...

01:02:56.250 --> 01:03:00.420
How much does Akai-san 
know about that spy?

01:03:00.420 --> 01:03:02.250
Not much, apparently.

01:03:02.250 --> 01:03:08.260
He only knows that they're Rum's confidant, and go by the codename Curaçao.

01:03:08.260 --> 01:03:09.930
Thanks, and be careful.

01:03:35.310 --> 01:03:36.250
Could it be...

01:03:37.810 --> 01:03:39.580
I knew it. 
There are five colors.

01:03:47.710 --> 01:03:49.300
If this is a key, then—

01:03:49.760 --> 01:03:53.800
She has an extremely rare injury 
in the fornix of her brain...

01:03:53.330 --> 01:03:55.770
She's pressing on her head 
and is in extreme pain.

01:03:55.580 --> 01:03:57.980
She's also saying something, 
but we don't know what it means...

01:03:57.640 --> 01:04:02.860
She said 
"Stout, Aquavit, and Riesling".

01:04:03.480 --> 01:04:04.480
I see.

01:04:04.480 --> 01:04:08.740
If my reasoning is right, then the Organization and Public Security's movements make sense.

01:04:11.930 --> 01:04:13.030
I have to hurry...

01:04:13.030 --> 01:04:15.950
Or else the NOC list will fall 
into the Organization's hands!

01:04:20.530 --> 01:04:22.170
Yes, yes.

01:04:22.170 --> 01:04:24.040
We took her into custody, 
as per your instructions.

01:04:24.040 --> 01:04:24.920
Oh?

01:04:24.920 --> 01:04:27.170
You're telling me 
to ride the Ferris wheel?

01:04:27.170 --> 01:04:29.920
Yes. 
It's not a sure-fire method...

01:04:29.920 --> 01:04:31.930
But right now, 
we can only take a chance on it.

01:04:31.930 --> 01:04:33.470
You'll do it, right?

01:04:33.470 --> 01:04:34.260
<i>Yes.</i>

01:04:34.260 --> 01:04:36.180
<i>That aside, 
we should meet up very soon.</i>

01:04:36.180 --> 01:04:39.810
No, we don't know where 
the Organization might be watching.

01:04:39.810 --> 01:04:41.890
I'll head to the Ferris wheel directly.

01:04:41.890 --> 01:04:42.690
Bye.

01:04:42.690 --> 01:04:44.270
<i>Please wait, Furuya-san—</i>

01:04:51.840 --> 01:04:52.990
Jeez.

01:04:52.990 --> 01:04:57.620
Why do I have to come to 
the aquarium during Golden Week?

01:04:57.620 --> 01:05:00.410
And to make things worse, 
I'm here with these kids!

01:05:01.230 --> 01:05:02.370
Hey, we're here!

01:05:02.370 --> 01:05:03.290
We've been waiting for this!

01:05:03.290 --> 01:05:03.920
Yay!

01:05:03.920 --> 01:05:05.170
Let's go!

01:05:05.170 --> 01:05:06.590
Wait, you guys.

01:05:06.590 --> 01:05:07.920
Stay right there.

01:05:07.920 --> 01:05:09.340
Okay!

01:05:09.340 --> 01:05:10.840
What will you do, Dad?

01:05:10.840 --> 01:05:13.720
I'm not in the mood 
for looking at fish today.

01:05:14.480 --> 01:05:17.840
I'll sleep here, 
so you go enjoy yourselves.

01:05:17.840 --> 01:05:19.140
Thanks.

01:05:28.520 --> 01:05:29.830
I'll go make the arrangements.

01:05:29.830 --> 01:05:30.530
Right.

01:05:32.900 --> 01:05:34.530
The aquarium again?

01:05:34.530 --> 01:05:37.780
I thought they'd surely 
take her to the scene of the accident.

01:05:37.780 --> 01:05:40.910
That woman had seizures 
on the Ferris wheel here.

01:05:40.910 --> 01:05:43.870
There might be some 
secret regarding that there.

01:05:44.700 --> 01:05:47.630
For now, let's stay here 
and keep an eye on the situation.

01:05:47.630 --> 01:05:48.420
Yes, sir.

01:05:48.420 --> 01:05:51.090
Sonoko-neechan's not here...

01:05:51.090 --> 01:05:52.080
Yeah...

01:05:52.080 --> 01:05:54.170
I'm sure she'll be here 
any minute now, though.

01:05:53.280 --> 01:05:54.840
I need you to let me ride 
the Ferris wheel.

01:05:54.840 --> 01:05:59.760
<i>I'm sorry, but ticket sales 
for today have ended.</i>

01:05:59.760 --> 01:06:02.850
Then, please tell this 
to the person in charge here.

01:06:02.850 --> 01:06:05.390
A Public Security officer 
requests your cooperation.

01:06:05.390 --> 01:06:06.560
<i>Very well.</i>

01:06:05.390 --> 01:06:06.560
Ran!

01:06:06.560 --> 01:06:08.690
<i>Please wait here.</i>

01:06:07.630 --> 01:06:08.690
Over here!

01:06:09.550 --> 01:06:11.110
Oh, she's finally here!

01:06:11.110 --> 01:06:12.280
Sonoko.

01:06:12.280 --> 01:06:14.900
Sorry to have kept you waiting. The formalities took some time.

01:06:14.900 --> 01:06:16.460
Yay!

01:06:16.460 --> 01:06:18.660
We knew you could do it, 
Sonoko-oneesan!

01:06:18.660 --> 01:06:21.410
You all better be grateful.

01:06:21.410 --> 01:06:22.790
We are!

01:06:22.790 --> 01:06:25.580
Sorry for making you 
give me a free ticket, too.

01:06:25.580 --> 01:06:27.080
No, don't worry about it.

01:06:27.080 --> 01:06:28.080
You didn't add any extra trouble.

01:06:28.080 --> 01:06:30.290
Well then, 
please look after the kids.

01:06:30.290 --> 01:06:30.920
Yes, of course.

01:06:30.920 --> 01:06:33.580
Now then, I'll lead the way 
to the Ferris wheel...

01:06:33.580 --> 01:06:34.970
So please follow me, everyone.

01:06:34.970 --> 01:06:35.920
Okay!

01:06:35.920 --> 01:06:36.840
Sure thing.

01:06:38.640 --> 01:06:40.550
Is it really okay 
to have her look after them?

01:06:40.550 --> 01:06:41.420
Yeah.

01:06:41.420 --> 01:06:44.140
She works as a tour guide here, 
so it's totally okay.

01:06:44.140 --> 01:06:47.560
That aside, are you sure you don't want to invite Shinichi-kun?

01:06:47.560 --> 01:06:48.400
Huh?!

01:06:48.400 --> 01:06:49.360
What should we do?

01:06:49.360 --> 01:06:51.400
Well, the most important thing
is to keep your guard up.

01:06:52.290 --> 01:06:53.400
What's wrong? 
You know them?

01:06:53.590 --> 01:06:54.480
No.

01:06:54.480 --> 01:06:56.010
That's not it...

01:06:56.010 --> 01:06:59.910
But I get the feeling I've seen that woman who's with the Public Security officers somewhere before.

01:06:59.910 --> 01:07:02.620
Those guys are Public Security officers?

01:07:02.620 --> 01:07:05.160
Yeah, I wonder 
if something has happened.

01:07:07.670 --> 01:07:08.860
What's with them?

01:07:08.860 --> 01:07:10.590
How irritating. 
Let's just go.

01:07:10.590 --> 01:07:11.170
Yeah.

01:07:13.330 --> 01:07:14.340
Sorry, Sonoko.

01:07:15.100 --> 01:07:17.970
I'm really concerned 
about those people we just saw.

01:07:17.970 --> 01:07:21.010
Just take the opportunity 
in front of you and give him a call.

01:07:32.590 --> 01:07:33.090
Crap.

01:07:33.090 --> 01:07:34.570
If this one's ringing, then it must be...

01:07:35.230 --> 01:07:36.320
I thought so.

01:07:37.820 --> 01:07:38.650
<i>What's up, Ran?</i>

01:07:38.650 --> 01:07:39.900
Oh, Shinichi?

01:07:39.900 --> 01:07:42.120
There's something
 I need to talk with you about.

01:07:42.120 --> 01:07:44.370
<i>What is it? 
Please keep it short.</i>

01:07:44.370 --> 01:07:45.710
You're busy right now?

01:07:45.430 --> 01:07:47.080
Tell me, tell me. 
What'd he say?

01:07:45.710 --> 01:07:47.080
<i>Y-Yeah.</i>

01:07:47.270 --> 01:07:49.460
C-Cut it out, Sonoko!

01:07:48.310 --> 01:07:49.460
Ran's really blushing!

01:07:49.640 --> 01:07:50.750
Jeez.

01:07:49.640 --> 01:07:50.750
<i>Stop!</i>

01:07:50.750 --> 01:07:52.210
Are you listening, Ran?

01:07:52.210 --> 01:07:53.840
<i>Sorry, but 
I'm swamped right now.</i>

01:07:53.840 --> 01:07:54.630
<i>So I'm hanging up.</i>

01:07:55.180 --> 01:07:55.500
Oh!

01:07:55.500 --> 01:07:56.840
<i>Wait, Shinichi!</i>

01:07:56.620 --> 01:08:01.300
<i>Thank you for visiting 
the Touto Aquarium today.</i>

01:07:56.840 --> 01:07:57.510
I'll call you back 
once things settle down here.

01:07:57.510 --> 01:07:58.550
<i>I'll call you back 
once things settle down here.</i>

01:07:58.550 --> 01:07:59.510
Wait, don't tell me...

01:07:59.510 --> 01:08:01.300
Where are you right now?

01:07:59.700 --> 01:08:01.300
<i>Hanging up!</i>

01:08:02.410 --> 01:08:03.680
That guy...

01:08:03.680 --> 01:08:06.220
He said something about him being busy 
and hung up again, didn't he?!

01:08:06.220 --> 01:08:07.060
Yeah...

01:08:07.060 --> 01:08:09.520
Where is he, 
and what could he be doing?

01:08:09.520 --> 01:08:11.480
About that, 
it sounded like he's here.

01:08:11.480 --> 01:08:12.190
Huh?

01:08:12.190 --> 01:08:13.310
What do you mean?

01:08:13.310 --> 01:08:17.230
I heard the intercom announcement here 
coming through Shinichi's phone..

01:08:17.230 --> 01:08:18.440
I see...

01:08:19.000 --> 01:08:20.700
So the problem is: 
Who is he with?

01:08:20.700 --> 01:08:21.610
Huh?

01:08:21.610 --> 01:08:22.780
You sure are naive!

01:08:22.780 --> 01:08:25.870
Do you really think a guy 
would come to a place like this alone?!

01:08:25.870 --> 01:08:28.460
Now, let's go catch 
that cheater red-handed!

01:08:28.460 --> 01:08:29.000
What?!

01:08:29.000 --> 01:08:30.870
Hey, Sonoko!

01:08:41.380 --> 01:08:42.840
Well, nothing I can do about it.

01:08:50.080 --> 01:08:51.020
All done.

01:08:51.020 --> 01:08:52.770
Now they won't immediately 
find you when you show up.

01:08:52.770 --> 01:08:54.480
<i>Now they won't immediately 
find you when you show up.</i>

01:08:54.480 --> 01:08:55.860
Nice work.

01:08:57.600 --> 01:08:58.410
Hurry!

01:08:58.410 --> 01:09:00.280
We'll begin taking 
action in 15 minutes.

01:09:00.280 --> 01:09:00.900
Got it!

01:09:00.900 --> 01:09:01.900
Let's get this thing moving!

01:09:06.660 --> 01:09:13.460
<i>Thank you for riding the 
Touto Aquarium's Ferris wheel today.</i>

01:09:13.460 --> 01:09:17.540
<i>It is almost time for 
the special water and light show...</i>

01:09:17.540 --> 01:09:20.170
<i>But due to inspections 
on the North Wheel...</i>

01:09:29.470 --> 01:09:30.430
A shortcut!

01:09:30.430 --> 01:09:32.890
Hold on just a sec, you guys.

01:09:32.890 --> 01:09:34.310
Who might they be?

01:09:34.310 --> 01:09:36.640
They're the friends of Suzuki-sama.

01:09:36.640 --> 01:09:37.100
What?!

01:09:37.100 --> 01:09:40.320
Then, this side is reserved 
just for these kids?!

01:09:40.320 --> 01:09:41.990
Seems like it.

01:09:43.240 --> 01:09:48.520
<i>The special light and water show 
that you all have been waiting for...</i>

01:09:48.520 --> 01:09:51.320
<i>Will begin in 30 minutes.</i>

01:09:49.520 --> 01:09:50.500
Damn it!

01:09:49.520 --> 01:09:50.500
Damn it!

