Farewell, Curaçao.

01:23:39.930 --> 01:23:41.160
<i>Stop.</i>

01:23:41.350 --> 01:23:42.830
T-This can't be...

01:23:45.940 --> 01:23:48.670
W-What are you doing here?!

01:23:48.670 --> 01:23:50.790
<i>Stand down, Vermouth.</i>

01:23:59.680 --> 01:24:02.680
<i>You have no "color", Curaçao.</i>

01:24:02.680 --> 01:24:05.430
<i>There is only pitch-black 
darkness in you.</i>

01:24:05.430 --> 01:24:06.930
R-Rum?

01:24:06.930 --> 01:24:12.940
<i>If that darkness is torturing you, 
simply dye it another color.</i>

01:24:12.940 --> 01:24:17.440
<i>You shall use that special brain of yours 
for me and me alone.</i>

01:24:17.440 --> 01:24:20.700
<i>Both input and output.</i>

01:24:20.700 --> 01:24:25.450
<i>And you will become 
my right arm, Curaçao.</i>

01:24:28.450 --> 01:24:29.730
Hey, are you okay?

01:24:29.730 --> 01:24:30.540
Hang in there!

01:24:31.420 --> 01:24:33.250
Sheesh...
Hold on a minute.

01:24:33.250 --> 01:24:35.800
I'll call an ambulance for you now.

01:24:35.800 --> 01:24:37.130
That won't be necessary.

01:24:46.500 --> 01:24:48.100
So her memory returned, after all.

01:24:49.500 --> 01:24:52.060
Curaçao has entered 
the pick up area.

01:24:53.840 --> 01:24:56.110
Two minutes until she reaches the top.

01:24:56.110 --> 01:24:58.320
<i>Isn't it about time to start?</i>

01:24:59.550 --> 01:25:01.140
Vodka, bring out the arm.

01:25:01.140 --> 01:25:01.900
Roger!

01:25:03.910 --> 01:25:05.780
Opening the hatch.

01:25:20.800 --> 01:25:24.590
Judging by the sound of the rotors, 
they should already be nearby.

01:25:20.800 --> 01:25:24.590
Judging by the sound of the rotors, 
they should already be nearby.

01:25:32.040 --> 01:25:35.520
What are they planning 
on starting here?!

01:25:46.730 --> 01:25:47.530
Could it be...

01:25:50.080 --> 01:25:51.650
Who's this?

01:25:51.650 --> 01:25:53.460
<i>It's been a while, Vermouth.</i>

01:25:54.210 --> 01:25:56.460
Sounds like your memories 
have come back, after all.

01:25:56.460 --> 01:25:57.420
Yeah.

01:25:57.420 --> 01:25:59.710
More importantly, 
when is my pick up coming?

01:25:59.710 --> 01:26:03.050
It seems the outside is swarming 
with Public Security agents.

01:26:03.050 --> 01:26:04.050
<i>That's not a problem...</i>

01:26:04.050 --> 01:26:06.220
<i>Because Gin is on his way to you.</i>

01:26:06.220 --> 01:26:07.140
Gin?!

01:26:07.140 --> 01:26:08.180
Yeah.

01:26:08.180 --> 01:26:10.680
By the way, when did 
your memories come back?

01:26:10.680 --> 01:26:14.270
<i>I heard Rum's been 
contacted from your phone.</i>

01:26:14.270 --> 01:26:18.480
<i>If you weren't the one 
who sent the message...</i>

01:26:19.810 --> 01:26:20.610
Oh, that message?

01:26:20.610 --> 01:26:23.030
I'm the one who sent it, of course.

01:26:23.030 --> 01:26:24.400
Is there any problem with it?

01:26:24.400 --> 01:26:25.490
I see.

01:26:25.490 --> 01:26:28.320
<b>In that case, Kir and Bourbon 
are in the clear.</b>

01:26:25.490 --> 01:26:28.320
<b>In that case, Kir and Bourbon 
are in the clear.</b>

01:26:28.320 --> 01:26:31.620
<b>So he ran away because he didn't 
want to be needlessly killed?</b>

01:26:28.320 --> 01:26:31.620
<b>So he ran away because he didn't 
want to be needlessly killed?</b>

01:26:32.540 --> 01:26:34.910
It's almost time, Cinderella.

01:26:34.910 --> 01:26:37.790
Wait right where you are 
for your pumpkin carriage to arrive.

01:26:37.790 --> 01:26:38.750
<i>Okay.</i>

01:26:39.670 --> 01:26:40.800
Five seconds left.

01:26:40.800 --> 01:26:41.880
Three...

01:26:41.880 --> 01:26:42.920
Two...

01:26:42.920 --> 01:26:43.880
One...

01:26:43.880 --> 01:26:44.670
Zero!

01:26:58.100 --> 01:26:58.980
What?!

01:27:00.090 --> 01:27:01.440
Damn it! 
They've already started!

01:27:02.510 --> 01:27:04.190
The signal from Vermouth 
has been confirmed.

01:27:04.190 --> 01:27:06.700
The grounds have been 
engulfed in darkness.

01:27:06.700 --> 01:27:07.450
Okay.

01:27:08.090 --> 01:27:09.660
Begin descending at once.

01:27:09.660 --> 01:27:11.700
Snatch Curaçao out of there!

01:27:11.700 --> 01:27:12.450
Aye aye, sir!

01:27:14.950 --> 01:27:16.870
Please calm down! 
We have everything under control!

01:27:16.870 --> 01:27:19.880
The lights will be restored shortly. 
Please remain calm and stay where you are.

01:27:16.870 --> 01:27:19.880
It's a little dangerous, 
so please don't run around!

01:27:19.880 --> 01:27:22.590
We ask for your 
cooperation in this.

01:27:19.880 --> 01:27:21.540
Hey, look over there!

01:27:21.540 --> 01:27:24.010
The aquarium still has its lights on!

01:27:24.010 --> 01:27:25.260
Hey, let's go there.

01:27:25.260 --> 01:27:25.880
Okay.

01:27:25.880 --> 01:27:26.990
Come on!
Let's go, everyone!

01:27:26.990 --> 01:27:27.800
No, don't!

01:27:27.800 --> 01:27:30.140
It's not safe, 
so please don't move!

01:27:38.710 --> 01:27:40.190
<b>I have a terrible feeling about this.</b>

01:27:38.710 --> 01:27:40.190
<b>I have a terrible feeling about this.</b>

01:27:40.190 --> 01:27:42.270
<b>I have to get the kids 
out of there, and quickly!</b>

01:27:40.190 --> 01:27:42.270
<b>I have to get the kids 
out of there, and quickly!</b>

01:27:42.270 --> 01:27:45.280
What's this? 
A blackout in a place like this?

01:27:45.280 --> 01:27:46.990
We sure are unlucky.

01:27:46.990 --> 01:27:49.030
Just a little longer, 
and we would've made it down, too...

01:27:49.030 --> 01:27:50.190
How's it going?

01:27:50.190 --> 01:27:51.760
It's no good. 
It's not going through.

01:27:51.760 --> 01:27:53.790
What's Kazami-san doing?

01:27:55.300 --> 01:27:57.290
Sato-kun. Takagi-kun.

01:27:57.290 --> 01:28:01.290
It seems the Public Security folks 
don't fully grasp the situation, either.

01:28:01.290 --> 01:28:02.000
I thought so.

01:28:02.000 --> 01:28:03.710
What should we do, then?

01:28:03.710 --> 01:28:05.840
Let's offer them our assistance.

01:28:05.840 --> 01:28:07.300
But those guys are...

01:28:07.300 --> 01:28:10.840
This is not the time to argue about the difference in positions.

01:28:10.840 --> 01:28:12.010
Understood?

01:28:12.010 --> 01:28:12.850
Yes, sir!

01:28:12.850 --> 01:28:15.520
Doesn't look like he's here, either.

01:28:15.520 --> 01:28:16.350
Yeah...

01:28:16.350 --> 01:28:17.980
Sorry, Sonoko.

01:28:17.980 --> 01:28:20.500
I may have just been mistaken.

01:28:20.500 --> 01:28:22.190
Hey, look outside!

01:28:22.190 --> 01:28:23.360
You won't believe what's going on!

01:28:26.050 --> 01:28:26.820
Let me through!

01:28:26.820 --> 01:28:28.610
Excuse me. 
Please let me see, too.

01:28:29.390 --> 01:28:30.110
What is this?!

01:28:30.110 --> 01:28:31.490
What's going on?

01:28:32.450 --> 01:28:34.990
I can't tell the wires 
apart in this darkness.

01:28:34.990 --> 01:28:37.750
I was just about 
to finish disarming it...

01:28:37.750 --> 01:28:40.620
But they took away my vision 
at the most critical time.

01:28:48.570 --> 01:28:52.890
I can go back to the Organization 
if I just sit still here, huh?

01:28:59.160 --> 01:28:59.770
Don't tell me...

01:28:59.770 --> 01:29:02.020
They're using that 
to take the gondola?!

01:29:06.010 --> 01:29:06.480
Who's that?!

01:29:08.990 --> 01:29:10.990
Excellent aircraft control!

01:29:10.990 --> 01:29:12.490
20 until our mark.

01:29:12.490 --> 01:29:14.030
I'll keep going at this pace!

01:29:18.450 --> 01:29:19.830
A Public Security agent...

01:29:19.830 --> 01:29:24.000
So the one who jumped out 
earlier really was Curaçao!

01:29:24.000 --> 01:29:24.750
This is bad!

01:29:27.650 --> 01:29:28.670
Wake up, mister!

01:29:28.670 --> 01:29:30.090
Mister!

01:29:33.320 --> 01:29:35.850
I don't stand a chance 
against them with this rifle...

01:29:35.850 --> 01:29:38.470
But there has to be 
a weak point somewhere.

01:29:45.770 --> 01:29:47.200
Damn it!

01:29:58.240 --> 01:30:00.370
Is it no use trying 
from this distance?

01:30:00.370 --> 01:30:02.290
Okay, let's move out.

01:30:02.290 --> 01:30:03.290
Aye aye, sir!

01:30:03.290 --> 01:30:04.620
At 8 o'clock...

01:30:04.620 --> 01:30:06.420
Above the Ferris wheel...

01:30:06.420 --> 01:30:07.750
I saw something move.

01:30:07.750 --> 01:30:09.670
Public Security 
made a run for it, huh?

01:30:09.670 --> 01:30:11.750
Inspect the gondola 
with the heat sensor!

01:30:11.750 --> 01:30:12.300
Roger!

01:30:14.490 --> 01:30:16.550
T-That's the outline of a man?!

01:30:16.550 --> 01:30:19.060
There's also a a kid riding it, too.

01:30:19.060 --> 01:30:21.140
Bro, Curaçao ain't on it!

01:30:21.140 --> 01:30:21.850
What?!

01:30:23.180 --> 01:30:24.850
Curaçao!

01:30:24.850 --> 01:30:25.980
Discard the gondola.

01:30:25.980 --> 01:30:27.190
R-Roger.

01:30:28.240 --> 01:30:29.070
Oh, come on...

01:30:30.060 --> 01:30:31.190
You've gotta be kidding me!

01:30:39.120 --> 01:30:40.950
What's that?!

01:30:44.480 --> 01:30:46.040
Gin, what's going on?

01:30:46.040 --> 01:30:47.500
<i>Curaçao has disappeared.</i>

01:30:47.500 --> 01:30:48.420
What?!

01:30:48.420 --> 01:30:49.630
<i>Change of plans.</i>

01:30:49.630 --> 01:30:51.000
<i>We'll dispose of Curaçao.</i>

01:30:51.000 --> 01:30:52.300
Don't be hasty.

01:30:52.300 --> 01:30:54.550
<i>You don't know 
whether she's betrayed us yet.</i>

01:30:54.550 --> 01:30:56.470
She left the gondola.

01:30:56.470 --> 01:30:59.340
Can you think of any reason for doing that, 
other than her running away?

01:30:59.340 --> 01:31:00.640
Find Curaçao at once!

01:31:00.640 --> 01:31:01.570
Roger.

01:31:01.570 --> 01:31:03.930
Chianti, get us away 
from the Ferris wheel.

01:31:03.930 --> 01:31:04.910
Aye aye, sir.

01:31:04.910 --> 01:31:07.230
Korn, get the IDWS ready.

01:31:07.230 --> 01:31:08.230
Understood.

01:31:23.950 --> 01:31:25.330
<b>Don't tell me that's—</b>

01:31:23.950 --> 01:31:25.330
<b>Don't tell me that's—</b>

01:31:34.090 --> 01:31:34.960
What?

01:31:34.960 --> 01:31:37.680
Are you planning 
on taking me back to them?

01:31:37.680 --> 01:31:39.090
Them?

01:31:39.090 --> 01:31:40.300
You mean the Organization?

01:31:40.300 --> 01:31:42.680
<b>So her memories 
really did come back.</b>

01:31:40.300 --> 01:31:42.680
<b>So her memories 
really did come back.</b>

01:31:42.680 --> 01:31:44.680
Could you possibly be...

01:31:44.680 --> 01:31:46.600
Sherry, who 
betrayed the Organization?

01:31:48.580 --> 01:31:50.190
Now, we're running away.

01:31:50.190 --> 01:31:51.520
It's not safe here.

01:31:51.520 --> 01:31:53.480
What do you mean, "run away"?

01:31:53.480 --> 01:31:55.360
If this is some kind of a bad joke, 
can you just stop?!

01:31:55.360 --> 01:31:56.900
Gin is here.

01:31:56.900 --> 01:31:59.410
You should know 
very well what that means.

01:32:00.430 --> 01:32:01.910
B-But, why did you save me?

01:32:01.910 --> 01:32:03.560
I don't know.

01:32:03.560 --> 01:32:06.160
I have no idea why I saved you.

01:32:06.160 --> 01:32:09.830
Still, I am Curaçao 
who can assume any color!

01:32:09.830 --> 01:32:14.210
And I prefer the current me 
over the old me.

01:32:14.880 --> 01:32:16.670
That's all there is to it!

01:32:19.730 --> 01:32:22.180
Now let's go, Sherry-chan.

01:32:22.180 --> 01:32:22.930
Wait!

01:32:22.930 --> 01:32:25.810
The kids are 
still aboard the gondola!

01:32:25.810 --> 01:32:27.560
We have to hurry and save them!

01:32:30.810 --> 01:32:33.400
I don't know 
what happened, but now...

01:32:34.190 --> 01:32:35.080
All right!

01:32:35.080 --> 01:32:37.070
I can distinguish the wires 
from the detonator!

01:32:37.070 --> 01:32:38.990
Focus.

01:32:38.990 --> 01:32:40.780
Be careful, and 
don't get ahead of yourself.

01:32:40.780 --> 01:32:42.070
But do it fast!

01:32:44.680 --> 01:32:45.490
Mister!

01:32:46.910 --> 01:32:48.620
Hang in there, Mister!

01:32:51.020 --> 01:32:52.330
This isn't good!

01:32:56.820 --> 01:32:57.840
Still?

01:32:57.840 --> 01:33:00.340
You still can't find Curaçao?!

01:33:00.340 --> 01:33:02.720
There are shadows 
moving on the Ferris wheel...

01:33:03.420 --> 01:33:05.350
Two kids and some adults.

01:33:05.350 --> 01:33:06.810
And this one is bad news!

01:33:06.810 --> 01:33:07.260
Bro!

01:33:07.260 --> 01:33:09.950
There's somebody 
close to the detonator!

01:33:09.950 --> 01:33:10.480
What?!

01:33:10.480 --> 01:33:12.350
Look, right here.

01:33:12.350 --> 01:33:15.230
If I remember right, 
it's mounted inside this fire hose box.

01:33:16.840 --> 01:33:19.650
Public Security found out about it?

01:33:19.650 --> 01:33:22.530
These are the last two cords 
connected to the detonator.

01:33:26.330 --> 01:33:28.370
Now I just need to 
cut this, and I'm done.

01:33:36.590 --> 01:33:37.420
I did it!

01:33:39.790 --> 01:33:41.510
That was a really close one.

01:33:51.760 --> 01:33:53.520
Shower them, Korn...

01:33:53.520 --> 01:33:55.310
Rain down bullets on them!

01:33:58.620 --> 01:34:00.180
Now that's what I'm talking about!

01:34:00.180 --> 01:34:01.400
Do it, Korn.

01:34:01.400 --> 01:34:02.940
Understood!

01:34:09.700 --> 01:34:11.700
W-What is going on?!

01:34:14.260 --> 01:34:15.960
Damn it! 
I've got to do something!

01:34:20.570 --> 01:34:22.420
This isn't good. 
I have to hurry.

01:34:23.990 --> 01:34:25.800
So even sniping from 
above is out of the question?

01:34:29.130 --> 01:34:30.310
It's no good.

01:34:30.310 --> 01:34:33.350
Looks like it's hard to get through 
because everyone else here is calling, too.

01:34:34.090 --> 01:34:36.350
I hope those kids are okay.

01:34:36.350 --> 01:34:38.860
Hurry, jump!

01:34:38.860 --> 01:34:39.980
Run!

01:34:55.740 --> 01:34:56.830
Damn it!

01:34:56.830 --> 01:34:58.850
I'm targeted the instant I move...

01:34:58.850 --> 01:35:00.540
I can't do anything at this rate!

01:35:01.550 --> 01:35:03.800
I'm the one they're after.

01:35:04.870 --> 01:35:07.170
Don't tell me you're 
planning to act as a decoy!

01:35:07.170 --> 01:35:09.300
I'll leave the kids to you.

01:35:09.300 --> 01:35:11.060
Don't! 
You'll get yourself killed!

01:35:16.180 --> 01:35:18.020
This movement and form...

01:35:18.020 --> 01:35:19.520
Make no mistake. 
That's Curaçao!

01:35:23.840 --> 01:35:24.610
What?!

01:35:24.610 --> 01:35:26.740
Now they're concentrating 
their strikes in one area.

01:35:27.780 --> 01:35:29.320
They're targeting someone.

01:35:29.320 --> 01:35:30.780
Now's my chance to move!

01:35:34.540 --> 01:35:36.040
Die, Curaçao!

01:35:59.440 --> 01:36:00.270
No way...

01:36:03.390 --> 01:36:05.400
All response from 
Curaçao has disappeared.

01:36:05.400 --> 01:36:07.110
Mission accomplished!

01:36:07.110 --> 01:36:09.570
No, not yet.

01:36:09.570 --> 01:36:12.410
We still have to finish off the rats.

01:36:12.410 --> 01:36:14.200
Aim at the bombs on the axle.

01:36:14.200 --> 01:36:16.620
T-The axle?

01:36:16.620 --> 01:36:17.870
Yeah.

01:36:17.870 --> 01:36:19.610
If Curaçao was still alive...

01:36:19.610 --> 01:36:24.170
She would be likely to take advantage of the panic from the Ferris wheel collapsing to get away...

01:36:24.170 --> 01:36:26.920
But this is fine for taking care of
 the likes of Public Security.

01:36:26.920 --> 01:36:27.920
Korn!

01:36:27.920 --> 01:36:30.590
Reload the machine gun immediately, 
and take down the axle!

01:36:30.590 --> 01:36:33.140
Let's put an end to this 
before the Air Self-Defense Force arrives.

01:36:33.140 --> 01:36:34.010
Understood.

01:36:34.010 --> 01:36:35.100
I'll end this.

01:36:37.510 --> 01:36:38.430
Haibara-san!

01:36:39.880 --> 01:36:41.060
Are you guys all okay?

01:36:41.060 --> 01:36:42.230
Y-Yeah...

01:36:42.230 --> 01:36:45.110
Ai-chan, 
what's going on here?

01:36:45.110 --> 01:36:46.860
I'll tell you everything later.

01:36:46.860 --> 01:36:48.690
But for now, just stay calm.

01:36:48.690 --> 01:36:49.860
Okay.

01:36:48.690 --> 01:36:49.860
Sure.

01:36:49.860 --> 01:36:52.360
Akai-san!

01:36:52.360 --> 01:36:53.580
Amuro-san!

01:36:53.580 --> 01:36:54.620
Over here.

01:36:55.470 --> 01:36:56.120
Akai-san!

01:36:59.040 --> 01:37:00.710
Are you okay, kid?

01:37:00.710 --> 01:37:01.370
Yeah.

01:37:01.370 --> 01:37:02.750
You have to hide.

01:37:02.750 --> 01:37:04.710
I can still hear 
the sound of the rotors.

01:37:06.040 --> 01:37:07.210
Where's Amuro-san?

01:37:07.210 --> 01:37:08.420
No idea.

01:37:08.420 --> 01:37:11.840
But since they switched 
to attacking directly...

01:37:11.840 --> 01:37:14.730
He must have succeeded 
in disarming the bomb.

01:37:14.730 --> 01:37:16.480
So now it's a matter 
of how to deal with them.

01:37:16.480 --> 01:37:18.350
Is that rifle just for show?!

01:37:20.400 --> 01:37:21.350
Amuro-san!

01:37:21.350 --> 01:37:25.110
Don't you have any way 
to counterattack, FBI?

01:37:25.110 --> 01:37:26.800
There are ways.

01:37:26.800 --> 01:37:29.490
But my night-vision scope 
has been laid to waste...

01:37:29.490 --> 01:37:34.120
And now all I can use is this 
regular scope I brought with me as a spare.

01:37:34.120 --> 01:37:37.240
And I can't shoot down that 
huge steel crow in the dead of night with this.

01:37:37.240 --> 01:37:39.450
You'd be able to take them down 
if you could see them?

01:37:39.450 --> 01:37:40.450
Yes.

01:37:40.450 --> 01:37:41.750
But how?

01:37:41.750 --> 01:37:44.710
Targeting the couplings 
of the rotor should do it.

01:37:44.710 --> 01:37:46.750
I couldn't see any couplings!

01:37:46.750 --> 01:37:49.250
Direct confrontation 
is out of the question.

01:37:49.250 --> 01:37:51.640
But if we could somehow throw them off 
from their current position...

01:37:51.640 --> 01:37:55.140
And then shine a light in the direction 
of the rotors for about five seconds...

01:37:55.790 --> 01:37:57.890
I think I can shine light on them...

01:37:57.890 --> 01:38:00.930
But unless I have some idea of what they look like, 
I won't be able to aim at the rotors.

01:38:08.550 --> 01:38:11.070
Don't tell me they plan 
on making the axle explode?!

01:38:11.070 --> 01:38:14.070
They plan on having 
the entire Ferris wheel collapse?

01:38:15.730 --> 01:38:16.920
This isn't good.

01:38:16.920 --> 01:38:19.540
Half of the explosives 
are still on the axle!

01:38:21.250 --> 01:38:22.790
Shoot, shoot, shoot!

01:38:24.190 --> 01:38:25.170
Dammit!

01:38:25.170 --> 01:38:27.250
I can tell which direction 
they're shooting from...

01:38:27.250 --> 01:38:29.130
But I don't know 
where the rotors are!

01:38:29.130 --> 01:38:32.260
You just need to have a general 
idea of what they look like, right?

01:38:33.030 --> 01:38:33.760
Here we go...

01:38:36.370 --> 01:38:37.760
Don't waste this chance!

01:38:45.970 --> 01:38:47.060
I can see it!

01:38:53.560 --> 01:38:56.110
Go!

01:39:13.340 --> 01:39:14.340
That light...

01:39:14.340 --> 01:39:15.220
It's fireworks!

01:39:15.220 --> 01:39:17.550
W-What's that?!

01:39:17.550 --> 01:39:18.470
Fireworks...?

01:39:18.470 --> 01:39:19.680
We're under attack!

01:39:19.680 --> 01:39:21.390
B-But where in the world from?!

01:39:25.510 --> 01:39:26.230
You're going down!

01:39:34.600 --> 01:39:35.320
Did we do it?!

01:39:35.320 --> 01:39:36.240
All right!

01:39:44.110 --> 01:39:45.200
Shit! Shit!

01:39:45.200 --> 01:39:47.210
We'll crash down at this rate!

01:39:47.210 --> 01:39:48.460
Korn, move aside!

01:39:52.650 --> 01:39:53.750
Damn it!

01:39:56.290 --> 01:39:58.630
It'll be a disaster 
if the axle gets destroyed!

01:40:38.290 --> 01:40:39.930
This thing won't hold up any longer. 
Time to bail out!

01:40:43.190 --> 01:40:44.850
Run!

01:40:44.850 --> 01:40:47.810
Run! 
Get away from the aquarium!

01:40:51.840 --> 01:40:52.900
This is really bad!

01:40:52.900 --> 01:40:55.020
If it keeps rolling like that, 
it'll hit the aquarium!

01:41:00.890 --> 01:41:03.700
Just who in the world 
were those guys?

01:41:04.760 --> 01:41:08.700
I have no interest in people 
standing at death's door.

01:41:09.720 --> 01:41:17.750
<i>All guests in the park are to move to the stadium of the dolphin show immediately.</i>

01:41:09.720 --> 01:41:10.730
Everyone!

01:41:10.730 --> 01:41:13.500
Please move to the stadium 
for the dolphin show immediately!

01:41:13.500 --> 01:41:14.710
It's not safe here!

01:41:14.710 --> 01:41:15.460
The Ferris wheel...

01:41:15.460 --> 01:41:17.750
Ran! 
We have to get out of here!

01:41:31.300 --> 01:41:33.100
Crap! 
The hill's making it go faster!

01:41:31.300 --> 01:41:33.100
Crap! 
The hill's making it go faster!

01:41:33.100 --> 01:41:34.560
Conan-kun!

01:41:36.530 --> 01:41:37.440
Amuro-san!

01:41:37.440 --> 01:41:38.860
Can you stop it?!

01:41:38.860 --> 01:41:41.030
I don't know... 
But I have to try!

01:41:46.810 --> 01:41:47.910
Amuro-san!

01:41:47.910 --> 01:41:49.660
I'm fine. Just focus!

01:41:52.080 --> 01:41:53.120
Here we go!

01:41:53.120 --> 01:41:53.580
Okay.

01:42:01.330 --> 01:42:05.590
Please make it!

01:42:09.920 --> 01:42:10.850
Akai-san!

01:42:10.850 --> 01:42:12.770
You have some sort of plan, right?

01:42:31.780 --> 01:42:32.330
How about this?!

01:42:35.320 --> 01:42:36.080
All right!

01:42:36.080 --> 01:42:37.540
No, it's still not working...?

01:42:39.300 --> 01:42:40.800
It's no use! 
It's not stopping!

01:42:39.740 --> 01:42:40.800
Sonoko, hurry up!

01:42:40.820 --> 01:42:41.960
Run!

01:42:41.960 --> 01:42:43.510
That won't be enough to stop it!

01:42:43.510 --> 01:42:45.430
That's okay! 
I still have a trick up my sleeve!

01:42:48.750 --> 01:42:49.850
Kudo-kun?!

01:42:52.510 --> 01:42:54.810
Damn it! 
We'll never make it at this rate!

01:42:56.580 --> 01:42:57.690
Stop! 
Don't rush into things!

01:42:58.610 --> 01:43:00.650
Akai-san!

01:43:09.180 --> 01:43:11.450
How about this?!

01:43:14.190 --> 01:43:15.500
Ran!

01:43:15.500 --> 01:43:17.210
Isn't that ball...?

01:43:17.210 --> 01:43:18.460
Inflate!

01:43:18.460 --> 01:43:19.920
Faster!

01:43:20.630 --> 01:43:22.500
Bigger!

01:43:22.500 --> 01:43:23.550
Run!

01:43:23.550 --> 01:43:25.010
Watch out!

01:43:27.000 --> 01:43:28.890
It's no use. 
It's not stopping!

01:43:53.030 --> 01:43:54.120
You guys...

01:43:59.740 --> 01:44:03.420
Stop!

01:44:20.550 --> 01:44:22.110
Did it stop?

01:44:22.110 --> 01:44:24.440
Alright! It stopped!

01:44:24.440 --> 01:44:26.530
Conan-kun 
must've stopped it!

01:44:26.530 --> 01:44:29.030
Hurray!

01:44:34.300 --> 01:44:35.330
What an amazing kid.

01:44:35.330 --> 01:44:39.080
He actually managed to 
stop that huge Ferris wheel.

01:44:40.500 --> 01:44:43.840
That mobile crane... 
Who could have been driving it?

01:44:43.840 --> 01:44:47.090
You did well, kid.

01:44:47.800 --> 01:44:49.090
Y-Yeah...

01:44:59.320 --> 01:45:02.270
Please wait. 
I want to confirm the body.

01:45:02.270 --> 01:45:04.180
Oh, we don't mind...

01:45:04.180 --> 01:45:07.280
But the body's in no condition 
to be able to distinguish anything.

01:45:07.280 --> 01:45:10.320
Okay, good work. 
You may go now.

01:45:13.100 --> 01:45:14.200
Is that...?

01:45:14.200 --> 01:45:14.910
Yeah.

01:45:16.060 --> 01:45:16.540
Kid.

01:45:16.540 --> 01:45:19.330
Do you mind showing me 
what you just picked up?

01:45:20.980 --> 01:45:22.540
What is this?

01:45:22.540 --> 01:45:24.880
Don't tell me 
it's flash memory?!

01:45:24.880 --> 01:45:25.710
No.

01:45:26.910 --> 01:45:29.300
It's not memory, but a memento.

01:45:32.500 --> 01:45:35.300
Although it's been 
burned and charred black.

01:45:51.820 --> 01:45:56.830
You've already given up on heading out on your own?

01:45:57.160 --> 01:46:01.830
I'm sure I told you this once before, but it's not like I blame you for anything...

01:46:02.040 --> 01:46:07.130
For we're both just a bunch of countless, tangled threads.

01:46:08.040 --> 01:46:12.920
There are convoluted and pointless days, and days we lose in battle...

01:46:13.300 --> 01:46:18.390
Travel on, and you'll find yourself facing them somewhere along the way.

01:46:18.390 --> 01:46:23.270
Even the many tragedies you experience...

01:46:23.940 --> 01:46:29.730
May just be faithful reproductions of dreams you've had.

01:46:32.400 --> 01:46:36.150
Ah, this world...

01:46:37.990 --> 01:46:42.620
Takes on your colors.

01:46:43.580 --> 01:46:46.920
Sometimes it may be kind...

01:46:48.590 --> 01:46:54.010
And sometimes even cruel.

01:46:54.880 --> 01:47:01.100
For every spoken word takes wing upon the wind.

01:47:10.820 --> 01:47:15.740
Through repeated unreasonable requests, and increasingly manic schedules...

01:47:16.280 --> 01:47:21.200
I'm drenched in sweat and exhausted from one minor regret after another.

01:47:21.660 --> 01:47:26.670
But no matter how far I go to meet you halfway, we just can't see eye to eye.

01:47:27.080 --> 01:47:31.840
I just continue misdirecting my concern...

01:47:31.840 --> 01:47:37.340
In this tunnel that has no end in sight.

01:47:37.340 --> 01:47:43.220
But even so, I'll keep moving forward.

01:47:46.020 --> 01:47:49.770
Ah, this world...

01:47:51.360 --> 01:47:56.400
Takes on your colors.

01:47:56.990 --> 01:48:00.780
Scream out so loud it hurts...

01:48:02.080 --> 01:48:07.370
And gaze into the bright days ahead.

01:48:08.540 --> 01:48:14.880
For the feelings born here will make waves.

01:48:18.880 --> 01:48:24.350
What we're seeing again today...

01:48:24.350 --> 01:48:27.730
Is the unmistakeable truth.

01:48:29.890 --> 01:48:35.150
Even though we're all the same...

01:48:35.150 --> 01:48:39.900
In that we live, following our feelings of love.

01:49:05.390 --> 01:49:09.390
Ah, this world...

01:49:10.640 --> 01:49:15.440
Takes on your colors.

01:49:15.940 --> 01:49:19.900
So speak carefully...

01:49:21.320 --> 01:49:26.410
And act boldly.

01:49:27.620 --> 01:49:34.540
For there's someone watching over you as you summon up your courage.

01:49:54.200 --> 01:49:59.030
<i>In regards to the explosions 
at the Touto Aquarium last night...</i>

01:49:57.720 --> 01:49:59.650
Man, I was so close.

01:49:59.030 --> 01:50:04.530
<i>The National Police Agency announced that they found the remains of the foreigner behind those explosions.</i>

01:49:59.650 --> 01:50:02.030
Oh, come on... 
You sure suck at this.

01:50:02.030 --> 01:50:05.370
Then why don't you give it 
a try this time, Genta-kun?

01:50:04.530 --> 01:50:12.330
<i>After causing the collapse of the Ferris wheel, 
the attacker stole a nearby vehicle.</i>

01:50:05.370 --> 01:50:06.380
Fine.

01:50:06.380 --> 01:50:07.030
Let me show you!

01:50:07.030 --> 01:50:08.740
You know...

01:50:08.600 --> 01:50:13.160
Aw... I wish I could 
be as good as that lady.

01:50:08.740 --> 01:50:11.910
She told me that 
she wanted to save us.

01:50:11.910 --> 01:50:13.160
Yeah.

01:50:12.330 --> 01:50:16.520
<i>The wheel eventually caught up 
to the attacker's stolen vehicle...</i>

01:50:13.160 --> 01:50:15.960
Come to think of it, 
I wonder where that lady went?

01:50:14.230 --> 01:50:17.420
If she didn't, she wouldn't have held onto that keychain just before dying.

01:50:15.960 --> 01:50:18.130
She must be doing well.

01:50:16.520 --> 01:50:18.130
<i>In which they met their end.</i>

01:50:18.130 --> 01:50:22.050
Are you talking about the amnesiac you met at the aquarium?

01:50:18.280 --> 01:50:21.210
But I still don't get why she did.

01:50:22.050 --> 01:50:23.050
Yeah!

01:50:23.050 --> 01:50:24.800
We played games in the hospital.

01:50:24.800 --> 01:50:26.730
And we even gave her a keychain!

01:50:26.730 --> 01:50:29.680
It made her so happy, didn't it?!

01:50:29.680 --> 01:50:33.060
Yeah, we all have matching ones.

01:50:33.060 --> 01:50:33.760
Here's mine.

01:50:33.760 --> 01:50:34.810
And here's mine!

01:50:34.810 --> 01:50:36.090
Wow.

01:50:36.090 --> 01:50:39.070
But she's not here anymore...

01:50:39.070 --> 01:50:42.990
She must have went back to where she 
came from after she got her memories back.

01:50:42.990 --> 01:50:46.450
We were so close 
to becoming her friend, too...

01:50:46.450 --> 01:50:47.620
I know...

01:50:47.620 --> 01:50:49.520
But, you know...

01:50:49.520 --> 01:50:51.830
Aren't you already her friend?

01:50:51.830 --> 01:50:54.250
You all are thinking 
so much about her, after all.

01:50:54.250 --> 01:50:55.250
I see.

01:50:55.250 --> 01:50:56.670
Yes, you're right.

01:50:56.670 --> 01:50:57.330
Yeah!

01:50:57.330 --> 01:50:59.140
We're friends!

01:50:57.330 --> 01:51:01.250
It's possible that those guys 
are what changed her.

01:51:01.250 --> 01:51:02.340
Yeah.

01:51:02.340 --> 01:51:09.350
At the very end, her color changed.

01:51:26.440 --> 01:51:30.240
So it's "though I try to hide it", huh?
